(412007, 36745, 10414, '<td valign="top">It sure doesn''t look very itty bitty!! I love your choice to photograph him from behind (or maybe you had no choice?) And I also love the way his little legs are clinging to his web. A wonderful, creative shot!!!   :)</td>', 'It sure doesn''t look very itty bitty!! I love your choice to photograph him from behind (or maybe you had no choice?) And I also love the way his little legs are clinging to his web. A wonderful, creative shot!!!   :)', '2003-09-08 02:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(412010, 36357, 10414, '<td valign="top">Ahh...poor little guy thinks he''s hiding so well too!! I love these things...the way their head will follow your finger if you move it from side to side in front of their face. A very nice, clear shot....great job!!!!  :)</td>', 'Ahh...poor little guy thinks he''s hiding so well too!! I love these things...the way their head will follow your finger if you move it from side to side in front of their face. A very nice, clear shot....great job!!!!  :)', '2003-09-08 02:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
