(412079, 36745, 9285, '<td valign="top">Nice close up....</td>', 'Nice close up....', '2003-09-08 04:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(412080, 36841, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting and different. Tantalising (because I want to see what it is) and frsutrating (because I can''t) at the same time. I think the biggest problem is that the front edge of the leaf is blurred - the legs draw your eye to it and its fuzzines is jarring, but if you''d got this in focus, the legs may not have been. Original shot.</td>', 'Interesting and different. Tantalising (because I want to see what it is) and frsutrating (because I can''t) at the same time. I think the biggest problem is that the front edge of the leaf is blurred - the legs draw your eye to it and its fuzzines is jarring, but if you''d got this in focus, the legs may not have been. Original shot.', '2003-09-08 04:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(412081, 36867, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice bee shot. Looks like focus point is slightly in front of the bee, but colours and compostion are attractive.</td>', 'Nice bee shot. Looks like focus point is slightly in front of the bee, but colours and compostion are attractive.', '2003-09-08 04:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(412082, 36558, 3290, '<td valign="top">Attractive subject, good composition, nicelt blurred background. Only complaint is that it''s blow out on the extreme highlights.</td>', 'Attractive subject, good composition, nicelt blurred background. Only complaint is that it''s blow out on the extreme highlights.', '2003-09-08 04:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(412083, 36296, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice and close. Looks sharp too, but the subject is a little dark to make out real detail on it - have you thought of using a fill flash?</td>', 'Nice and close. Looks sharp too, but the subject is a little dark to make out real detail on it - have you thought of using a fill flash?', '2003-09-08 04:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(412085, 36728, 3290, '<td valign="top">Lots goinf on, but there seems to be something wrong with the colours. Looks like CA, or perhaps you used \''Auto Levels\'' in PS? Nice sense of perspective.</td>', 'Lots goinf on, but there seems to be something wrong with the colours. Looks like CA, or perhaps you used \''Auto Levels\'' in PS? Nice sense of perspective.', '2003-09-08 04:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(412086, 36690, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting - what is it? Seems a little dark and over-contrasty though.</td>', 'Interesting - what is it? Seems a little dark and over-contrasty though.', '2003-09-08 04:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(412087, 36177, 3290, '<td valign="top">Hope the bug didn''t get frostbite. Interesting idea, but the bright ice means the bug has turned out a bit too dark. I like the blue.</td>', 'Hope the bug didn''t get frostbite. Interesting idea, but the bright ice means the bug has turned out a bit too dark. I like the blue.', '2003-09-08 04:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(412088, 36575, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting, colourful subject but is somewhat overexposed. Also, I''d like to see the subject''s face more (either get up the other end, or make it a profile shot).</td>', 'Interesting, colourful subject but is somewhat overexposed. Also, I''d like to see the subject''s face more (either get up the other end, or make it a profile shot).', '2003-09-08 04:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(412089, 36054, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, but there seems to be a blue cast in various places. Did you use ''Auto levels'' in PS?</td>', 'Nice and sharp, but there seems to be a blue cast in various places. Did you use ''Auto levels'' in PS?', '2003-09-08 04:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(412090, 36192, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but is rather too dark and without much contrast.</td>', 'Good composition, but is rather too dark and without much contrast.', '2003-09-08 04:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(412091, 36775, 9285, '<td valign="top">Great Details... Nice colours composition..</td>', 'Great Details... Nice colours composition..', '2003-09-08 04:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(412093, 36768, 3290, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but find the centre of the flower, though OOF, distracts me from the butterflies face. Also, it looks a little ocersharpened (light halo around the eyes and legs).</td>', 'I like the composition, but find the centre of the flower, though OOF, distracts me from the butterflies face. Also, it looks a little ocersharpened (light halo around the eyes and legs).', '2003-09-08 04:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(412094, 36459, 9285, '<td valign="top">Impressive Sharpness.. .. <br/>Nice vibrant colours..</td>', 'Impressive Sharpness.. .. Nice vibrant colours..', '2003-09-08 04:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(412095, 36572, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty. Interesting subject, good sharpness and DOF. Nicely exposed. Might have worked better in a portrait format, but is still good.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-09-15 01:31:21.</i></td>', 'Pretty. Interesting subject, good sharpness and DOF. Nicely exposed. Might have worked better in a portrait format, but is still good.', '2003-09-08 04:35:39.000000', '2003-09-15 02:31:21.000000', 1),
(412096, 36823, 3290, '<td valign="top">Like the droplets. Not sure about the B&amp;W - would have liked to see a colour version. Also, expected to see a spider (or did the bug eat it? :-)</td>', 'Like the droplets. Not sure about the B&W - would have liked to see a colour version. Also, expected to see a spider (or did the bug eat it? :-)', '2003-09-08 04:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(412097, 36843, 9285, '<td valign="top">Nice Colours... Rich... I like the red-orange contrast against the gray.</td>', 'Nice Colours... Rich... I like the red-orange contrast against the gray.', '2003-09-08 04:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(412098, 36483, 3290, '<td valign="top">Intereting and colour ful subject. Compsootion is fine, but could really use more DOF - too much of the wing and (crucially) the eye are out of focus. Could you try a smaller aperture?</td>', 'Intereting and colour ful subject. Compsootion is fine, but could really use more DOF - too much of the wing and (crucially) the eye are out of focus. Could you try a smaller aperture?', '2003-09-08 04:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(412099, 36529, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice, but could be a little sharper. Would like to see this subject in profile, to show off the herringbone pattern on the legs (I know it''s not easy).</td>', 'Nice, but could be a little sharper. Would like to see this subject in profile, to show off the herringbone pattern on the legs (I know it''s not easy).', '2003-09-08 04:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(412100, 36545, 3290, '<td valign="top">Colourful, but I''d like to be able to see the butterfly''s head more clearly (perhaps e higher viewpoint would help).</td>', 'Colourful, but I''d like to be able to see the butterfly''s head more clearly (perhaps e higher viewpoint would help).', '2003-09-08 04:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(412101, 36784, 9285, '<td valign="top">Great Details... Impressive shot... might want to lighten the photo a little.. but it may be just my monitor :o) 8</td>', 'Great Details... Impressive shot... might want to lighten the photo a little.. but it may be just my monitor :o) 8', '2003-09-08 04:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(412102, 36780, 3290, '<td valign="top">Never seen one of these before! Good detail on the eyes and head. Shame the antennae aren''t a bit more in focus. Also, the legs would be quite striking but get a bit lost in the flower.</td>', 'Never seen one of these before! Good detail on the eyes and head. Shame the antennae aren''t a bit more in focus. Also, the legs would be quite striking but get a bit lost in the flower.', '2003-09-08 04:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(412103, 36833, 3290, '<td valign="top">I like the colourful OOF background, but would like to see the subject occupy more of the shot. The inside of the right wing is blown out.</td>', 'I like the colourful OOF background, but would like to see the subject occupy more of the shot. The inside of the right wing is blown out.', '2003-09-08 04:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(412104, 36635, 3290, '<td valign="top">Cool subject. I think I''d have been tempted to lose the bottom section of the shot (from around the top of the leaf which obscures its abdomen) to concentrate on that amazing face and those forelegs.</td>', 'Cool subject. I think I''d have been tempted to lose the bottom section of the shot (from around the top of the leaf which obscures its abdomen) to concentrate on that amazing face and those forelegs.', '2003-09-08 04:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(412105, 36745, 3290, '<td valign="top">Shame we can''t see its face (I have many shots of spiders'' backsides, and very few of ther faces - strange that). The spider is nicely on focus with the background nicely blurred. DOD looks good too.</td>', 'Shame we can''t see its face (I have many shots of spiders'' backsides, and very few of ther faces - strange that). The spider is nicely on focus with the background nicely blurred. DOD looks good too.', '2003-09-08 04:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(412106, 36313, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - shame you couldn''t get around to see its face. Focus is where it should be and its good to see the wasp feeding.<br/> <br/>I left a piece of plum out in the hope that ti would attract wasps. I got diddly squat. If I''d had a picnic, I''d have been inundated with the things.</td>', 'Nice shot - shame you couldn''t get around to see its face. Focus is where it should be and its good to see the wasp feeding. I left a piece of plum out in the hope that ti would attract wasps. I got diddly squat. If I''d had a picnic, I''d have been inundated with the things.', '2003-09-08 04:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(412107, 36539, 9285, '<td valign="top">Nice angle.. I like the shot.. it has a different feel from the rest of the shots - However, might want to give the object some space from the border... :o) 8</td>', 'Nice angle.. I like the shot.. it has a different feel from the rest of the shots - However, might want to give the object some space from the border... :o) 8', '2003-09-08 04:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(412108, 36687, 3290, '<td valign="top">This is nice. I like the way you haven''t tried to include the whole butterfly but have concentrated on its face. I like the composition (and the way the wings frame the head) and sharpness/DOF is good. Perhaps just a little more light on the face would have helpd (fill flash?) but this is still a nice shot. Well done.</td>', 'This is nice. I like the way you haven''t tried to include the whole butterfly but have concentrated on its face. I like the composition (and the way the wings frame the head) and sharpness/DOF is good. Perhaps just a little more light on the face would have helpd (fill flash?) but this is still a nice shot. Well done.', '2003-09-08 04:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(412109, 36470, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - pretty amazing DOF with the wings pretty sharp from edge to edge. What lens did you take this with? The problem with this type of shot is that you don''t get too see much detail, becasue the head/body are relatively small. Background is nicely blurred.</td>', 'Nice shot - pretty amazing DOF with the wings pretty sharp from edge to edge. What lens did you take this with? The problem with this type of shot is that you don''t get too see much detail, becasue the head/body are relatively small. Background is nicely blurred.', '2003-09-08 04:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(412110, 36804, 3290, '<td valign="top">:-) I''d have cropped a lot off the left to focus in on the bugs. Nice take, though.</td>', ':-) I''d have cropped a lot off the left to focus in on the bugs. Nice take, though.', '2003-09-08 04:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(412111, 36816, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nearly a good shot - not quite in focus and a little overexposed on the abdome and leg. Shooting with a half-bright and half-dark background makes it difficult. Did you (could you) try centre-weighted metering?</td>', 'Nearly a good shot - not quite in focus and a little overexposed on the abdome and leg. Shooting with a half-bright and half-dark background makes it difficult. Did you (could you) try centre-weighted metering?', '2003-09-08 04:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(412112, 36880, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty. Nice muted tones in the subject, flower and background. Would like to see the butterfly more head-on though.</td>', 'Pretty. Nice muted tones in the subject, flower and background. Would like to see the butterfly more head-on though.', '2003-09-08 04:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(412113, 36879, 10869, '<td valign="top">a bit ouf of focus and too blurry; nice insect though</td>', 'a bit ouf of focus and too blurry; nice insect though', '2003-09-08 04:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(412114, 36760, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nicely caught (I love hoverlfies) but a little dark. Have you tried a flash for this sort of shot?</td>', 'Nicely caught (I love hoverlfies) but a little dark. Have you tried a flash for this sort of shot?', '2003-09-08 04:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(412115, 36449, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot. I''d like to see a bigger version of this. Colours, lighting and DOF are all good and focus looks like it''s where it should be. I''d suggest cropping some off the top and bottom.</td>', 'Pretty shot. I''d like to see a bigger version of this. Colours, lighting and DOF are all good and focus looks like it''s where it should be. I''d suggest cropping some off the top and bottom.', '2003-09-08 05:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(412116, 36824, 10869, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors, and nice focus!</td>', 'beautiful colors, and nice focus!', '2003-09-08 05:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(412117, 36851, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, but head isn''t in focus and lighting is a bit too dark.</td>', 'Interesting subject, but head isn''t in focus and lighting is a bit too dark.', '2003-09-08 05:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(412118, 36774, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective, but is a little soft - looks like camera shake?</td>', 'Interesting perspective, but is a little soft - looks like camera shake?', '2003-09-08 05:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(412119, 36340, 3290, '<td valign="top">Simple. Pretty. Effective. A nice shot.</td>', 'Simple. Pretty. Effective. A nice shot.', '2003-09-08 05:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(412120, 36874, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but a little overexposed. You could probably fix this in PS.</td>', 'Nice composition, but a little overexposed. You could probably fix this in PS.', '2003-09-08 05:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(412121, 36874, 10869, '<td valign="top">a bit overexposed</td>', 'a bit overexposed', '2003-09-08 05:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(412122, 36843, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice close up of an interesting subject. Not much to criticise here, but I can''t help thinking it would work better rotated 90 degrees anticlockwise.</td>', 'Nice close up of an interesting subject. Not much to criticise here, but I can''t help thinking it would work better rotated 90 degrees anticlockwise.', '2003-09-08 05:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(412123, 36496, 3290, '<td valign="top">Yow! Poor damselfly. Shame you chopped off the damsel at the bottom and there''s a blue tinge here and there which looks a bit weird. But I like the action.</td>', 'Yow! Poor damselfly. Shame you chopped off the damsel at the bottom and there''s a blue tinge here and there which looks a bit weird. But I like the action.', '2003-09-08 05:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(412124, 36784, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot - nice and sharp with pleasant colours. It''s a shame the butterfly''s left antenna gets lost in the blue flowers, though. And I think the whole thing would benefit from being just a tad brighter. I like the backlighting on the wings.</td>', 'Pretty shot - nice and sharp with pleasant colours. It''s a shame the butterfly''s left antenna gets lost in the blue flowers, though. And I think the whole thing would benefit from being just a tad brighter. I like the backlighting on the wings.', '2003-09-08 05:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(412146, 36545, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good capture and composition. The lighting and color mix is spot on.</td>', 'Good capture and composition. The lighting and color mix is spot on.', '2003-09-08 07:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(412157, 36471, 5728, '<td valign="top">Only to be found in New Zealand of course :-) When I was younger and at school  I always got told that if one of these things bites you then it stays stuck in your skin and it is difficult to get them off. Is that true, or just a story? I never did find out. They give me the creeps!<br/> <br/>Anyway, shooting a weta was a good idea. It is in focus and sharp, however I would have rather seen it with all the feelers in the frame.</td>', 'Only to be found in New Zealand of course :-) When I was younger and at school  I always got told that if one of these things bites you then it stays stuck in your skin and it is difficult to get them off. Is that true, or just a story? I never did find out. They give me the creeps! Anyway, shooting a weta was a good idea. It is in focus and sharp, however I would have rather seen it with all the feelers in the frame.', '2003-09-08 07:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(412158, 36872, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good one. I especially like the way the butterfly is being highlighted against that black background. Very nice.</td>', 'Good one. I especially like the way the butterfly is being highlighted against that black background. Very nice.', '2003-09-08 07:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(412159, 36037, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great idea, stands out in an otherwise forseeable challenge. Like the DOF, this one is going high. 9</td>', 'Great idea, stands out in an otherwise forseeable challenge. Like the DOF, this one is going high. 9', '2003-09-08 07:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(412160, 36496, 11738, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting photograph.  An action shot that conveys the impending doom faced by the dragonfly.  I would have increased the depth of field to see all of the dragonfly in focus. But I also understand that both bugs must have been moving quite quickly, making this shot difficult.</td>', 'This is a very interesting photograph.  An action shot that conveys the impending doom faced by the dragonfly.  I would have increased the depth of field to see all of the dragonfly in focus. But I also understand that both bugs must have been moving quite quickly, making this shot difficult.', '2003-09-08 07:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(412161, 36796, 11738, '<td valign="top">ROFL at the title!  It''s even funnier that the legs are straight out into the air... almost looks like a cartoon shot.</td>', 'ROFL at the title!  It''s even funnier that the legs are straight out into the air... almost looks like a cartoon shot.', '2003-09-08 07:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(412164, 36843, 11738, '<td valign="top">Love this one.  The angle makes it stimulating.  Good luck!</td>', 'Love this one.  The angle makes it stimulating.  Good luck!', '2003-09-08 07:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(412165, 36776, 10170, '<td valign="top">Ok, really impressed with this one ..... but I have to ask how did you manage that?  Care to share?</td>', 'Ok, really impressed with this one ..... but I have to ask how did you manage that?  Care to share?', '2003-09-08 07:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(412166, 36851, 7543, '<td valign="top">Truly amazing, ths lighting is perfect. Subject is great, love the humor, and the background doesnt take anything away from this one, a given ribbon if you ask me. Congrats - 10</td>', 'Truly amazing, ths lighting is perfect. Subject is great, love the humor, and the background doesnt take anything away from this one, a given ribbon if you ask me. Congrats - 10', '2003-09-08 07:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(412167, 36471, 11738, '<td valign="top">Cool bug.  Never sen one like it.</td>', 'Cool bug.  Never sen one like it.', '2003-09-08 07:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(412173, 36020, 10170, '<td valign="top">Amazing colours, I love it!</td>', 'Amazing colours, I love it!', '2003-09-08 08:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(412179, 36020, 9669, '<td valign="top">just browsing through the challenge, not voting, but this is great.  First the colours, then the patterns inthe mesh (?) and the eyes.  The clarity is spot on.  And finally, what lens are you using?  The closeness is incredible-- its almost a microscope...and it is focused from the feet to the top of the head.  best shot of challenge</td>', 'just browsing through the challenge, not voting, but this is great.  First the colours, then the patterns inthe mesh (?) and the eyes.  The clarity is spot on.  And finally, what lens are you using?  The closeness is incredible-- its almost a microscope...and it is focused from the feet to the top of the head.  best shot of challenge', '2003-09-08 08:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(412183, 36547, 11880, '<td valign="top">very good WOW!!</td>', 'very good WOW!!', '2003-09-08 08:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(412185, 36785, 11880, '<td valign="top">Perfect!!</td>', 'Perfect!!', '2003-09-08 08:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(412190, 36459, 11880, '<td valign="top">Perfecto!!</td>', 'Perfecto!!', '2003-09-08 08:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(412208, 36800, 9854, '<td valign="top">uhm,  yeah, it''s really a secret, I suppose</td>', 'uhm,  yeah, it''s really a secret, I suppose', '2003-09-08 09:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(412209, 36635, 9854, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I wish you had not cropped out the antennae and leg.</td>', 'Beautiful! I wish you had not cropped out the antennae and leg.', '2003-09-08 09:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(412211, 36192, 9854, '<td valign="top">I think adjusting the dark/light levels would improve the pic by reducing  the ''mist'' that dulls out the colors of the image</td>', 'I think adjusting the dark/light levels would improve the pic by reducing  the ''mist'' that dulls out the colors of the image', '2003-09-08 09:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(412212, 36020, 9854, '<td valign="top">Amazing eyes!</td>', 'Amazing eyes!', '2003-09-08 09:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(412213, 36843, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool subject.  I have never seen anything like it!  Framing may be slightly off, I''d like the overall shot better if I could see the second ant''s head.  Excellent Macro...  good job!</td>', 'This is a very cool subject.  I have never seen anything like it!  Framing may be slightly off, I''d like the overall shot better if I could see the second ant''s head.  Excellent Macro...  good job!', '2003-09-08 09:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(412227, 36693, 92, '<td valign="top">Great find on the cacoon. Beautiful detail and color !</td>', 'Great find on the cacoon. Beautiful detail and color !', '2003-09-08 09:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(412231, 36558, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail and color. Perfect DOF and use of thirds. Composition is right on the money. The only tiny issue I have is the leaf in top right draws the eye there. No biggy...awesome photo !</td>', 'Beautiful detail and color. Perfect DOF and use of thirds. Composition is right on the money. The only tiny issue I have is the leaf in top right draws the eye there. No biggy...awesome photo !', '2003-09-08 09:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(412236, 36846, 92, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo. The DOF and colors are wonderful. Good luck !</td>', 'Awesome photo. The DOF and colors are wonderful. Good luck !', '2003-09-08 10:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(412237, 36429, 9285, '<td valign="top">Neat Shot</td>', 'Neat Shot', '2003-09-08 10:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(412238, 36203, 9854, '<td valign="top">Technically, it isn''t an insect - ie it does not fall under Insecta, but under Arachnida. Trouble is, this scientific misnomer is propagated beyond this site. On the spider: nice capture of colors and even the fuzz.</td>', 'Technically, it isn''t an insect - ie it does not fall under Insecta, but under Arachnida. Trouble is, this scientific misnomer is propagated beyond this site. On the spider: nice capture of colors and even the fuzz.', '2003-09-08 10:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(412239, 36872, 9285, '<td valign="top">I love the colours... Nice composition too! :o)</td>', 'I love the colours... Nice composition too! :o)', '2003-09-08 10:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(412241, 36530, 9448, '<td valign="top">You have a good composition, with the bee slightly decentralised but still as very much the main focus of the image.  Technically I would say that the image is either slightly out of focus, or more likely you just have an exceptionally shallow depth of field as I think I can see part of the leaf in focus.<br/>Knowing my luck, you are probably a far better photographer than I, but as an overall impression I would just say work on either the depth of field or focus of the macro.</td>', 'You have a good composition, with the bee slightly decentralised but still as very much the main focus of the image.  Technically I would say that the image is either slightly out of focus, or more likely you just have an exceptionally shallow depth of field as I think I can see part of the leaf in focus.Knowing my luck, you are probably a far better photographer than I, but as an overall impression I would just say work on either the depth of field or focus of the macro.', '2003-09-08 10:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(412245, 36725, 9854, '<td valign="top">Like I''ve said in many other entries, this isn''t an insect, but an arachnid. They are entirely different, though they are both arthropods. It is unfortunate that this scientific misnomer is so widespread. As for the foto itself, it would have been better if you got more of the spider''s body rather than the silk.</td>', 'Like I''ve said in many other entries, this isn''t an insect, but an arachnid. They are entirely different, though they are both arthropods. It is unfortunate that this scientific misnomer is so widespread. As for the foto itself, it would have been better if you got more of the spider''s body rather than the silk.', '2003-09-08 10:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(412246, 36871, 9285, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2003-09-08 10:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(412248, 36557, 92, '<td valign="top">My only 10 so far and I''m almost finished voting. The color, detail, compostion and lighting are all there. That makes for a GREAT photo ! 10</td>', 'My only 10 so far and I''m almost finished voting. The color, detail, compostion and lighting are all there. That makes for a GREAT photo ! 10', '2003-09-08 10:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(412250, 36652, 9448, '<td valign="top">I see that you have the little grasshoppers eye right in the middle of your picture, personally though I would have preferred a slightly bigger image of the grasshopper (zoomed in a little bit more) so that I can see more detail.  On a technical note your focus appears fine with a blurry background.  Maybe you have a little bit too much fence in the picture, as that too is in focus and due to the size of the grasshopper is a little bit distracting to me.<br/>Overall a very high-quality picture just a little bit too zoomed out for my tastes.</td>', 'I see that you have the little grasshoppers eye right in the middle of your picture, personally though I would have preferred a slightly bigger image of the grasshopper (zoomed in a little bit more) so that I can see more detail.  On a technical note your focus appears fine with a blurry background.  Maybe you have a little bit too much fence in the picture, as that too is in focus and due to the size of the grasshopper is a little bit distracting to me.Overall a very high-quality picture just a little bit too zoomed out for my tastes.', '2003-09-08 10:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(412251, 36357, 2883, '<td valign="top">This might be a better photo if the sun was shining on the mantis instead of casting shadows on it.</td>', 'This might be a better photo if the sun was shining on the mantis instead of casting shadows on it.', '2003-09-08 10:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(412253, 36818, 2883, '<td valign="top">This is a great pose. I like the dark to light from top to bottom, but I think it could use a little more cropping at the bottom.</td>', 'This is a great pose. I like the dark to light from top to bottom, but I think it could use a little more cropping at the bottom.', '2003-09-08 10:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(412254, 36867, 9285, '<td valign="top">Great shot.. but a pity the flower took the attention off the bee..<br/>:o) still a 7 for me</td>', 'Great shot.. but a pity the flower took the attention off the bee..:o) still a 7 for me', '2003-09-08 10:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(412255, 36429, 2883, '<td valign="top">This is a great looking spider. The bright spot in the background is a little distracting.</td>', 'This is a great looking spider. The bright spot in the background is a little distracting.', '2003-09-08 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(412256, 36691, 2883, '<td valign="top">This is a good composition, but I think the colors could be brought out a little more and the overall picture brightened.</td>', 'This is a good composition, but I think the colors could be brought out a little more and the overall picture brightened.', '2003-09-08 10:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(412257, 36747, 2883, '<td valign="top">The greens in the background help this photo, but the ant is lost in the tree.</td>', 'The greens in the background help this photo, but the ant is lost in the tree.', '2003-09-08 10:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(412258, 36879, 9448, '<td valign="top">Hmm look at the legs on that.  I really like this picture, but I have to admit that I don''t recognise the insect.<br/>You have achieved a very shallow depth of field, but I feel that your title is trying to draw attention to the eyes, which are slightly out of focus.  As the legs are the main feature of the insect that are in focus, personally I feel that your title should have drawn attention to that as opposed to the eyes.  Though I can understand why you tried to draw attention to the eyes -- they look wonderful.<br/>In many of my recent insect shots I have found that I get slightly shallower depth of field than I actually wanted, and unfortunately this seems to have struck you on a particularly inconvenient image.<br/>An interesting crop and nice composition. Like the border too.</td>', 'Hmm look at the legs on that.  I really like this picture, but I have to admit that I don''t recognise the insect.You have achieved a very shallow depth of field, but I feel that your title is trying to draw attention to the eyes, which are slightly out of focus.  As the legs are the main feature of the insect that are in focus, personally I feel that your title should have drawn attention to that as opposed to the eyes.  Though I can understand why you tried to draw attention to the eyes -- they look wonderful.In many of my recent insect shots I have found that I get slightly shallower depth of field than I actually wanted, and unfortunately this seems to have struck you on a particularly inconvenient image.An interesting crop and nice composition. Like the border too.', '2003-09-08 10:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(412259, 36700, 2883, '<td valign="top">This is a nice, clear close-up. It might be better if it was taken with more than just green leaves to give it some color.</td>', 'This is a nice, clear close-up. It might be better if it was taken with more than just green leaves to give it some color.', '2003-09-08 10:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(412260, 36535, 2883, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo, though I think the colors could be enhanced a little more. I like the water drops on the leaves.</td>', 'This is a nice photo, though I think the colors could be enhanced a little more. I like the water drops on the leaves.', '2003-09-08 10:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(412261, 36557, 2883, '<td valign="top">This looks like a very proud grasshopper. I like the contrasts.</td>', 'This looks like a very proud grasshopper. I like the contrasts.', '2003-09-08 10:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(412263, 36728, 2883, '<td valign="top">This is a nice composition with the two spiders. The moth looks a little overly sharpened and I think it distracts from the photo.</td>', 'This is a nice composition with the two spiders. The moth looks a little overly sharpened and I think it distracts from the photo.', '2003-09-08 10:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(412264, 36799, 2883, '<td valign="top">The color is strong, but the bee could be a little sharper.</td>', 'The color is strong, but the bee could be a little sharper.', '2003-09-08 10:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(412265, 36717, 2883, '<td valign="top">This is a creative photo. I like the pewter on green contrasts.</td>', 'This is a creative photo. I like the pewter on green contrasts.', '2003-09-08 10:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(412266, 36851, 9448, '<td valign="top">He he, a lovely picture.  I really like the composition of this picture, the darkening upper part of the picture gives it a wonderful flair which is finished off exquisitely by the white border.  The location of the insects in the image is also very nice.<br/>Technically I would say that your depth of field is perhaps a tiny bit too shallow, but now I am picking.<br/>You leave me wondering as to where you took this picture as the surface that the insects are on looks very nice and does not detract from the image.  I actually took a picture of a butterfly on a grey background that I did not submit because the grey background detracted completely from the butterfly.<br/>This is one of the first pictures that I have looked at, but so far is my favourite -- top draw so far I think you will do very well.</td>', 'He he, a lovely picture.  I really like the composition of this picture, the darkening upper part of the picture gives it a wonderful flair which is finished off exquisitely by the white border.  The location of the insects in the image is also very nice.Technically I would say that your depth of field is perhaps a tiny bit too shallow, but now I am picking.You leave me wondering as to where you took this picture as the surface that the insects are on looks very nice and does not detract from the image.  I actually took a picture of a butterfly on a grey background that I did not submit because the grey background detracted completely from the butterfly.This is one of the first pictures that I have looked at, but so far is my favourite -- top draw so far I think you will do very well.', '2003-09-08 10:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(412267, 36471, 8624, '<td valign="top">great details on the spiky hooks on his legs!</td>', 'great details on the spiky hooks on his legs!', '2003-09-08 10:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(412271, 36557, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice closeup. would have preferred a simpler background and more room at the top of the frame for the antenna.</td>', 'nice closeup. would have preferred a simpler background and more room at the top of the frame for the antenna.', '2003-09-08 10:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(412274, 36874, 9448, '<td valign="top">Very nice from the picture all the way to the title.  I like the composition especially as the flower acts as a leading line to draw you straight into the ladybug.  The one thing I might be tempted to say is would a slightly darker background have been better, as it appears as though the edges of the ladybug are slightly overexposed due to the white background.  I also noticed that you have some slight water drops on this ladybug, leaves me wondering whether or not he was frozen in the freezer for a little while so that you could set up this shot?  My apologies if I am doing you an injustice by that observation.  The water droplets do add that extra little bit to the image.<br/>Technically I am uncertain as to whether or not you have enough depth of field, as parts of the ladybug are out of focus.  The flower appears to be in crisp focus and that is why I am guessing that your depth of field is a little bit too shallow.  The aforementioned overexposed edges of the ladybug detract only a tiny little bit.<br/>Great image I wish you well in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice from the picture all the way to the title.  I like the composition especially as the flower acts as a leading line to draw you straight into the ladybug.  The one thing I might be tempted to say is would a slightly darker background have been better, as it appears as though the edges of the ladybug are slightly overexposed due to the white background.  I also noticed that you have some slight water drops on this ladybug, leaves me wondering whether or not he was frozen in the freezer for a little while so that you could set up this shot?  My apologies if I am doing you an injustice by that observation.  The water droplets do add that extra little bit to the image.Technically I am uncertain as to whether or not you have enough depth of field, as parts of the ladybug are out of focus.  The flower appears to be in crisp focus and that is why I am guessing that your depth of field is a little bit too shallow.  The aforementioned overexposed edges of the ladybug detract only a tiny little bit.Great image I wish you well in the challenge.', '2003-09-08 10:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(412278, 36742, 8624, '<td valign="top">great detail and sharpness. would have liked to have seen more of a closeup</td>', 'great detail and sharpness. would have liked to have seen more of a closeup', '2003-09-08 10:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(412279, 36652, 8624, '<td valign="top">could have been a interesting composition with the split in the fence like that, but I''d like to see more details. get in closer next time.</td>', 'could have been a interesting composition with the split in the fence like that, but I''d like to see more details. get in closer next time.', '2003-09-08 10:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(412280, 36726, 8624, '<td valign="top">your model is braver then me. nice job with DOF on the bee. I would have liked the model''s eyes to be crossed in, looking at the bee.</td>', 'your model is braver then me. nice job with DOF on the bee. I would have liked the model''s eyes to be crossed in, looking at the bee.', '2003-09-08 10:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(412281, 36696, 8624, '<td valign="top">need more DOF here. all the good details are blurred out</td>', 'need more DOF here. all the good details are blurred out', '2003-09-08 10:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(412282, 36301, 9448, '<td valign="top">He''s an interesting little fellow isn''t he.  I like the composition of this picture, especially the angle at which you have the insect.  The insect is also middled in the picture, which obviously makes him the main focus of the image.  Your title also draws attention to the eyes of the bug, and it is nice to see that his eyes are quite close to a third to help draw your eyes towards the head of the insect.<br/> <br/>On a technical note I would say that you have either had to zoom in a lot to get this image, or that he is a tiny little bit out of focus.  It is either that or on this image you are going very slightly soft focus, which if that is a case then I apologise for my previous observation as it works very well in this image.  Either way you have a great image.</td>', 'He''s an interesting little fellow isn''t he.  I like the composition of this picture, especially the angle at which you have the insect.  The insect is also middled in the picture, which obviously makes him the main focus of the image.  Your title also draws attention to the eyes of the bug, and it is nice to see that his eyes are quite close to a third to help draw your eyes towards the head of the insect. On a technical note I would say that you have either had to zoom in a lot to get this image, or that he is a tiny little bit out of focus.  It is either that or on this image you are going very slightly soft focus, which if that is a case then I apologise for my previous observation as it works very well in this image.  Either way you have a great image.', '2003-09-08 10:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(412284, 36826, 8624, '<td valign="top">definitely get an extra point just for an original composition. I like the greens and the way the bug is framed by the grasses.</td>', 'definitely get an extra point just for an original composition. I like the greens and the way the bug is framed by the grasses.', '2003-09-08 10:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(412286, 36558, 9448, '<td valign="top">I have to admit to ignorance in terms of butterflies so I will take you by your word is the type.<br/> <br/>In terms of composition, if I am going to moan, then I would say that the leaf towards the top right detracts slightly from the butterfly.  Naturally I don''t have your original image to go by, but I think I would have tried to rotate the image a little bit and re-crop so that it wasn''t distracting from the butterfly.  It''s only a thought, but I briefly tried it in Photoshop and I have to say the butterfly stood out a little bit more, but in terms of use of the area I would have needed more image to work with to see if I could get a really good result.  This is just a very minor point, and I''m sure you considered it in your original crop.  I also like the fact that the butterfly is not quite in the middle of the picture.<br/> <br/>Technically I would say that your image is either spot-on in focus, or as near as makes no difference.  The depth of field also appears to be quite good, and from the crispness of the image there appears to be no camera shake to speak of.<br/> <br/>On a final note the image appears to have very good balance, and I think that it is yet another one that should do very well.</td>', 'I have to admit to ignorance in terms of butterflies so I will take you by your word is the type. In terms of composition, if I am going to moan, then I would say that the leaf towards the top right detracts slightly from the butterfly.  Naturally I don''t have your original image to go by, but I think I would have tried to rotate the image a little bit and re-crop so that it wasn''t distracting from the butterfly.  It''s only a thought, but I briefly tried it in Photoshop and I have to say the butterfly stood out a little bit more, but in terms of use of the area I would have needed more image to work with to see if I could get a really good result.  This is just a very minor point, and I''m sure you considered it in your original crop.  I also like the fact that the butterfly is not quite in the middle of the picture. Technically I would say that your image is either spot-on in focus, or as near as makes no difference.  The depth of field also appears to be quite good, and from the crispness of the image there appears to be no camera shake to speak of. On a final note the image appears to have very good balance, and I think that it is yet another one that should do very well.', '2003-09-08 10:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(412287, 36169, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice colors in the beetle and butterfly. background is too distracting though.</td>', 'nice colors in the beetle and butterfly. background is too distracting though.', '2003-09-08 10:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(412289, 36873, 8624, '<td valign="top">great simple colors, but get in closer!</td>', 'great simple colors, but get in closer!', '2003-09-08 10:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(412290, 36871, 9448, '<td valign="top">Sweet mother of God where did you find this specimen?<br/> <br/>This is one great image you have, I thought I might see some butterflies in this challenge but this one is a cracker.  In terms of composition and I would say that the background above and the right of the butterfly detract slightly, largely due to the bright lights.  This is however a very minor point due to the crisp focus you have.<br/> <br/>Technically I would love to be able to give you some advice, but this picture is way better than any that I have taken so any advice would be meaningless.  I guess if I attempted to mention anything, then I would have said that the tree to the left could hopefully have fallen out of focus a tiny bit faster.  This is however as much to do with the camera/lens as with the photographer.<br/> <br/>Top image -- I hope your final ranking is deserving of the image.</td>', 'Sweet mother of God where did you find this specimen? This is one great image you have, I thought I might see some butterflies in this challenge but this one is a cracker.  In terms of composition and I would say that the background above and the right of the butterfly detract slightly, largely due to the bright lights.  This is however a very minor point due to the crisp focus you have. Technically I would love to be able to give you some advice, but this picture is way better than any that I have taken so any advice would be meaningless.  I guess if I attempted to mention anything, then I would have said that the tree to the left could hopefully have fallen out of focus a tiny bit faster.  This is however as much to do with the camera/lens as with the photographer. Top image -- I hope your final ranking is deserving of the image.', '2003-09-08 10:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(412291, 36767, 6668, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the moth?</td>', 'I don''t see the moth?', '2003-09-08 10:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(412292, 36779, 8624, '<td valign="top">could be sharper, but it is a great view of a scary spiky hairy creature</td>', 'could be sharper, but it is a great view of a scary spiky hairy creature', '2003-09-08 10:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(412295, 36832, 9448, '<td valign="top">Now I went to a horse show recently, and I''ve seen this pose before -- but I''ve never seen a horse that looks quite like this one???<br/> <br/>In terms of composition I love the fact that he is not quite middled, as I feel that would have detracted from him.<br/> <br/>Technically the focus is spot-on, the depth of field is great and there is no camera shake at all.<br/> <br/>What else is there to say except great picture.</td>', 'Now I went to a horse show recently, and I''ve seen this pose before -- but I''ve never seen a horse that looks quite like this one??? In terms of composition I love the fact that he is not quite middled, as I feel that would have detracted from him. Technically the focus is spot-on, the depth of field is great and there is no camera shake at all. What else is there to say except great picture.', '2003-09-08 10:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(412299, 36843, 8624, '<td valign="top">wow! I''ve never seen these before. Are those abdomens or some fluid filled sac they carry around with them?</td>', 'wow! I''ve never seen these before. Are those abdomens or some fluid filled sac they carry around with them?', '2003-09-08 11:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(412301, 36539, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice reflection. good use of negative space, but I would have liked to have seen more details.</td>', 'nice reflection. good use of negative space, but I would have liked to have seen more details.', '2003-09-08 11:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(412303, 36874, 8624, '<td valign="top">This needs increased tonal range to really bring out the blacks more. composition is good, though.</td>', 'This needs increased tonal range to really bring out the blacks more. composition is good, though.', '2003-09-08 11:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(412304, 36882, 6668, '<td valign="top">The background is a little too distracting for me. Nice color in the fly though.</td>', 'The background is a little too distracting for me. Nice color in the fly though.', '2003-09-08 11:08:01.000000', NULL, 1);
