(412314, 36296, 3724, '<td valign="top">//www.discoverlife.org/nh/tx/Insecta/Hymenoptera/Apoidea/Apidae/Xylocopa/virginica/<br/>Carpenter bee.....  very good image......   Thank you for providing the latin name.</td>', '//www.discoverlife.org/nh/tx/Insecta/Hymenoptera/Apoidea/Apidae/Xylocopa/virginica/Carpenter bee.....  very good image......   Thank you for providing the latin name.', '2003-09-08 11:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(412315, 36652, 9504, '<td valign="top">Because the photo is so small, you can''t see much.  Can you make the picture bigger next time?  I like the fence, the gap, and the hopper -- I just wish I could see more detail.  <br/> <br/>You have an eye for this...I''d like to see more of your work!</td>', 'Because the photo is so small, you can''t see much.  Can you make the picture bigger next time?  I like the fence, the gap, and the hopper -- I just wish I could see more detail.   You have an eye for this...I''d like to see more of your work!', '2003-09-08 11:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(412316, 36824, 9504, '<td valign="top">You have a great macro lens!  These are the coolest bugs.  Great job!  Love the colors, the angle, the eye...well done.  Top runner in this challenge...</td>', 'You have a great macro lens!  These are the coolest bugs.  Great job!  Love the colors, the angle, the eye...well done.  Top runner in this challenge...', '2003-09-08 11:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
