(412324, 36856, 9504, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this photo, and the depth of field.  I just wish you focused more on the dragonfly...maybe zoomed in more or used a macro (though you might not have one on your camera).    You have a nice eye for photography!</td>', 'I like the colors in this photo, and the depth of field.  I just wish you focused more on the dragonfly...maybe zoomed in more or used a macro (though you might not have one on your camera).    You have a nice eye for photography!', '2003-09-08 11:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
