(412326, 36313, 9504, '<td valign="top">I was taking photos of these guys eating our grapes yesterday.  They devour fruit, don''t they?  Nice photo -- exceptionally clear, great colors, framing!  Nice job...</td>', 'I was taking photos of these guys eating our grapes yesterday.  They devour fruit, don''t they?  Nice photo -- exceptionally clear, great colors, framing!  Nice job...', '2003-09-08 11:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
