(412386, 36767, 1041, '<td valign="top">Even though this photo obviously meets the challenge according to your interpretation (otherwise you wouldn''t have submitted it), it doesn''t meet mine, sorry.  The intent, I believe, was to capture one or more insect closeup.  While you technically have insects in the shot, I can''t see any details of them. <br/> <br/>As for the photo, it''s not very appealing for me, either.  There''s nothing in sharp focus, even the stationary items (house, lamp).  The bright spot in the lower part (another bright light?) is distracting.  Sorry.  Remember this is just my personal opinion ...</td>', 'Even though this photo obviously meets the challenge according to your interpretation (otherwise you wouldn''t have submitted it), it doesn''t meet mine, sorry.  The intent, I believe, was to capture one or more insect closeup.  While you technically have insects in the shot, I can''t see any details of them.  As for the photo, it''s not very appealing for me, either.  There''s nothing in sharp focus, even the stationary items (house, lamp).  The bright spot in the lower part (another bright light?) is distracting.  Sorry.  Remember this is just my personal opinion ...', '2003-09-08 11:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
