(412395, 36800, 1041, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this doesn''t meet the challenge "get up close and personal".  I don''t see any insects here, even though I think I can see that''s the secret part, they are disguising themselves as humans.  You obviously disagree, otherwise you wouldn''t have submitted it.<br/> <br/>As for the photo itself, you have a nice tonality range going here, the focus and lighting is good, technically a well-rounded shot.  There''s a lot going on in the shot, too much in my opinion, I don''t know if there was something you could''ve changed though, candids don''t usually leave you time for it, you have to seize the moment, and you sure did here.</td>', 'In my opinion, this doesn''t meet the challenge "get up close and personal".  I don''t see any insects here, even though I think I can see that''s the secret part, they are disguising themselves as humans.  You obviously disagree, otherwise you wouldn''t have submitted it. As for the photo itself, you have a nice tonality range going here, the focus and lighting is good, technically a well-rounded shot.  There''s a lot going on in the shot, too much in my opinion, I don''t know if there was something you could''ve changed though, candids don''t usually leave you time for it, you have to seize the moment, and you sure did here.', '2003-09-08 12:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
