(412901, 36824, 11506, '<td valign="top">The title is PERFECT for this shot.  Very well done.  And I like the green border as well.  9</td>', 'The title is PERFECT for this shot.  Very well done.  And I like the green border as well.  9', '2003-09-08 19:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(412902, 36774, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  Did you rotate the pic? I can''t decide, but I guess it doesn''t matter.  Like the unobtrusive background, although, if the pic was not rotated, something that gives reference to where up is might have helped :)  Anyhow, I think your technical execution lets you down here.  There''s really nothing in crisp focus and where the plane of focus seems to be the closest is where the ant''s body is, not the head, which I personally would''ve preferred.</td>', 'Challenge met.  Did you rotate the pic? I can''t decide, but I guess it doesn''t matter.  Like the unobtrusive background, although, if the pic was not rotated, something that gives reference to where up is might have helped :)  Anyhow, I think your technical execution lets you down here.  There''s really nothing in crisp focus and where the plane of focus seems to be the closest is where the ant''s body is, not the head, which I personally would''ve preferred.', '2003-09-08 19:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(412903, 36851, 11506, '<td valign="top">If this was a bit lighter on the left side I would have given it a 10 just for the "look" on the mantis'' face.  Great title.</td>', 'If this was a bit lighter on the left side I would have given it a 10 just for the "look" on the mantis'' face.  Great title.', '2003-09-08 19:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(412905, 36607, 11506, '<td valign="top">This would have been an excellent shot if it was a bit more focused.</td>', 'This would have been an excellent shot if it was a bit more focused.', '2003-09-08 19:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(412906, 36203, 11506, '<td valign="top">Is that a male black widow?  I hope you''re not laying in a hospital now because of that.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Is that a male black widow?  I hope you''re not laying in a hospital now because of that.  Nice shot.', '2003-09-08 19:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(412907, 36285, 1041, '<td valign="top">The photo''s a bit on the small side, but not as small as others.  At least I can still see details.  I think you focused nicely and, even though your background is not OOF, it''s very unobtrusive, which is nice.  Maybe a tiny bit of an increase in saturation would be nice just to boosts colors a bit.  And a slightly larger submission next time round :)</td>', 'The photo''s a bit on the small side, but not as small as others.  At least I can still see details.  I think you focused nicely and, even though your background is not OOF, it''s very unobtrusive, which is nice.  Maybe a tiny bit of an increase in saturation would be nice just to boosts colors a bit.  And a slightly larger submission next time round :)', '2003-09-08 19:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(412910, 36774, 11506, '<td valign="top">It''s a little bit blurry but I''ll give you credit because I know ants don''t sit still very long.  (unless they''re dead)</td>', 'It''s a little bit blurry but I''ll give you credit because I know ants don''t sit still very long.  (unless they''re dead)', '2003-09-08 19:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(412912, 36784, 9385, '<td valign="top">Well Done!!  Now fess up, how did you get it to hold still? I found the frame to be distracting.</td>', 'Well Done!!  Now fess up, how did you get it to hold still? I found the frame to be distracting.', '2003-09-08 19:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(412913, 36742, 11506, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This may be my favortie thus far.</td>', 'Wow.  This may be my favortie thus far.', '2003-09-08 19:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(412915, 36435, 9385, '<td valign="top">This is so well done, I would like to have seen the whole insect.</td>', 'This is so well done, I would like to have seen the whole insect.', '2003-09-08 19:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(412916, 36449, 11506, '<td valign="top">The colors make this photo.  Well done.</td>', 'The colors make this photo.  Well done.', '2003-09-08 19:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(412917, 36529, 1041, '<td valign="top">Hehehe, he seems to be hanging on so he won''t fall off ;)  Nice capture of a grasshopper.  I always find it extremely difficult to (a) get close enough and (b) get a pic w/out lots of blades of grass in the front.  You have mastered both, even though I''d love for the little blade in the bottom right not to be there, but it''s not very distracting.  Nice colors and lighting, and he seems to be looking right at you.  Good job :)</td>', 'Hehehe, he seems to be hanging on so he won''t fall off ;)  Nice capture of a grasshopper.  I always find it extremely difficult to (a) get close enough and (b) get a pic w/out lots of blades of grass in the front.  You have mastered both, even though I''d love for the little blade in the bottom right not to be there, but it''s not very distracting.  Nice colors and lighting, and he seems to be looking right at you.  Good job :)', '2003-09-08 19:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(412921, 36292, 11506, '<td valign="top">Clever.  It''s nice to see something other than an insect and a plant.</td>', 'Clever.  It''s nice to see something other than an insect and a plant.', '2003-09-08 19:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(412924, 36725, 1041, '<td valign="top">Spiders and spiderwebs are very hard to photograph IMO since the background has a tendency to intrude.  This is happening here, too.  There''s too much background shining through and distracting, especially the blwong out sky in the top left.  Overall the pic is quite bright.  Also, I think it would be more appealing to actually see it from the side the spider is on to be able to see the spider better, but I suspect you weren''t able to get there.<br/> <br/>Btw, since there''s the hot discussion going on, I feel spiders are within the challenge guidelines and any score I give is purely based on the photo quality.  Just thought I should add that.  :)</td>', 'Spiders and spiderwebs are very hard to photograph IMO since the background has a tendency to intrude.  This is happening here, too.  There''s too much background shining through and distracting, especially the blwong out sky in the top left.  Overall the pic is quite bright.  Also, I think it would be more appealing to actually see it from the side the spider is on to be able to see the spider better, but I suspect you weren''t able to get there. Btw, since there''s the hot discussion going on, I feel spiders are within the challenge guidelines and any score I give is purely based on the photo quality.  Just thought I should add that.  :)', '2003-09-08 19:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(412926, 36818, 1041, '<td valign="top">Kinda cool tunnel the spider has built there.  Nice focus on the spider, I''d love to see it being more dominant in the shot.  Maybe cropping from the bottom and a bit from the top of the pic and turning it into a landscape?<br/> <br/>Btw, since there''s the hot discussion going on, I feel spiders are within the challenge guidelines and any score I give is purely based on the photo quality.  Just thought I should add that.  :)</td>', 'Kinda cool tunnel the spider has built there.  Nice focus on the spider, I''d love to see it being more dominant in the shot.  Maybe cropping from the bottom and a bit from the top of the pic and turning it into a landscape? Btw, since there''s the hot discussion going on, I feel spiders are within the challenge guidelines and any score I give is purely based on the photo quality.  Just thought I should add that.  :)', '2003-09-08 19:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(412927, 36873, 11506, '<td valign="top">Very creative.</td>', 'Very creative.', '2003-09-08 19:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(412929, 36799, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sweat bee!  (Looked for one all week!)  Nice shot.  A tad dark in the sunflower, otherwise pretty nice.  8 Rob the Swah</td>', 'Sweat bee!  (Looked for one all week!)  Nice shot.  A tad dark in the sunflower, otherwise pretty nice.  8 Rob the Swah', '2003-09-08 19:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(412930, 36776, 11506, '<td valign="top">If this was focused a bit more I''d have given it a 10.  It''s nice to see something creative.</td>', 'If this was focused a bit more I''d have given it a 10.  It''s nice to see something creative.', '2003-09-08 19:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(412931, 36696, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool shot and the narrow DOF seems purposeful, but I''d rather see a bit wider view of him.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cool shot and the narrow DOF seems purposeful, but I''d rather see a bit wider view of him.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-08 19:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(412932, 36607, 1041, '<td valign="top">Wow, quite an unusual capture.  Poor bee ;)  I think this would be a fantastic shot if it was executed a little better.  The straight-on, centered approach works here, and there''s nothing distracting in the background which is wonderful.  But the image doesn''t seem to be really sharp/focused anywhere and the colors could do with a little boost, too.  If you haven''t already used USM (unsharp mask) here, that would be worth a try.<br/> <br/>Btw, since there''s the hot discussion going on, I feel spiders are within the challenge guidelines and any score I give is purely based on the photo quality.  Just thought I should add that.  :)</td>', 'Wow, quite an unusual capture.  Poor bee ;)  I think this would be a fantastic shot if it was executed a little better.  The straight-on, centered approach works here, and there''s nothing distracting in the background which is wonderful.  But the image doesn''t seem to be really sharp/focused anywhere and the colors could do with a little boost, too.  If you haven''t already used USM (unsharp mask) here, that would be worth a try. Btw, since there''s the hot discussion going on, I feel spiders are within the challenge guidelines and any score I give is purely based on the photo quality.  Just thought I should add that.  :)', '2003-09-08 19:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(412933, 36780, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice sweat bee!  (I looked for one all week!)  Very nice shot.  Good DOF.  Love the color.  10 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very nice sweat bee!  (I looked for one all week!)  Very nice shot.  Good DOF.  Love the color.  10 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-08 19:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(412934, 36803, 11506, '<td valign="top">HOLY ZOOM BATMAN!</td>', 'HOLY ZOOM BATMAN!', '2003-09-08 19:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(412936, 36429, 1041, '<td valign="top">This is one of the better ones of the spidershots.  Your background is sufficiently blurry (if not very exciting) and the sunlight hitting the threads of the web highlight them well.  Plus, your spider is actually in focus and on the right side of the web.  Like it :)  The biggest distraction is the blown out sky, I think you could significantly improve the photo by cropping as much as possible of the top.<br/> <br/>Btw, since there''s the hot discussion going on, I feel spiders are within the challenge guidelines and any score I give is purely based on the photo quality.  Just thought I should add that.  :)</td>', 'This is one of the better ones of the spidershots.  Your background is sufficiently blurry (if not very exciting) and the sunlight hitting the threads of the web highlight them well.  Plus, your spider is actually in focus and on the right side of the web.  Like it :)  The biggest distraction is the blown out sky, I think you could significantly improve the photo by cropping as much as possible of the top. Btw, since there''s the hot discussion going on, I feel spiders are within the challenge guidelines and any score I give is purely based on the photo quality.  Just thought I should add that.  :)', '2003-09-08 19:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(412937, 36446, 11506, '<td valign="top">Oh, I like this one!  It''s not the standard bee on a flower!  Nice thinking.</td>', 'Oh, I like this one!  It''s not the standard bee on a flower!  Nice thinking.', '2003-09-08 19:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(412938, 36203, 1041, '<td valign="top">Awesome spidershot.  Very unusual background, but it works.  A little bit too bright in the top right (especially on the spider''s leg) ... actually, now that I''m counting, there are only 6 legs.  Either this is not a spider or you removed a few (ok, bad joke).  Hope you are not getting hit too hard by the "it''s a spider = 1" votes.<br/> <br/>Anyhow, like the coloring and everything.  There''s not much I would change.  :)</td>', 'Awesome spidershot.  Very unusual background, but it works.  A little bit too bright in the top right (especially on the spider''s leg) ... actually, now that I''m counting, there are only 6 legs.  Either this is not a spider or you removed a few (ok, bad joke).  Hope you are not getting hit too hard by the "it''s a spider = 1" votes. Anyhow, like the coloring and everything.  There''s not much I would change.  :)', '2003-09-08 19:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(412941, 36572, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice Morphio!  Great color and sharpness.  Easy 9...maybe even a 10..O.k. a 10.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very nice Morphio!  Great color and sharpness.  Easy 9...maybe even a 10..O.k. a 10.  Rob the Swash', '2003-09-08 19:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(412943, 36823, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Love the dew and b&amp;w works, even though if the same people comment on your shot as on mine, they might disagree :(  Nice focus and composition, even though I''d be happy to see just a little crop on the left (get rid of the OOF web and drops there) and a bit more breathing room to the right (although it''s not like the bug''s gonna go anywhere).  Nice shot!</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Love the dew and b&w works, even though if the same people comment on your shot as on mine, they might disagree :(  Nice focus and composition, even though I''d be happy to see just a little crop on the left (get rid of the OOF web and drops there) and a bit more breathing room to the right (although it''s not like the bug''s gonna go anywhere).  Nice shot!', '2003-09-08 19:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(412944, 36726, 1005, '<td valign="top">It''s dead, but that''s a cute shot anyway.  Good color,focus.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'It''s dead, but that''s a cute shot anyway.  Good color,focus.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-08 19:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
