(412952, 36049, 8130, '<td valign="top">Magnificent!  I love the colors, composition, just everything.  Since I entered a spider in this challenge, I''m giving your future insect a 10.  The photo deserves it.</td>', 'Magnificent!  I love the colors, composition, just everything.  Since I entered a spider in this challenge, I''m giving your future insect a 10.  The photo deserves it.', '2003-09-08 20:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
