(412976, 36780, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That is weeeeeird.  Never seen one like that.  Maybe it''''s an incredible Hulk wasp?  Great capture.  Thanks.  Jacko.</td>', 'Wow.  That is weeeeeird.  Never seen one like that.  Maybe it''''s an incredible Hulk wasp?  Great capture.  Thanks.  Jacko.', '2003-09-08 21:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
