(413022, 36687, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good shot!  Me thinks you have a good chance here, although with that many bugs at once, who knows what will happen :)  This one''s one of my favourites this time.  I love the crop, and the title, the whole thing fits together well.  Good job!  ~10<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-09-15 09:36:32.</i></td>', 'Good shot!  Me thinks you have a good chance here, although with that many bugs at once, who knows what will happen :)  This one''s one of my favourites this time.  I love the crop, and the title, the whole thing fits together well.  Good job!  ~10', '2003-09-08 21:37:49.000000', '2003-09-15 10:36:32.000000', 1),
(413023, 36820, 6624, '<td valign="top">I think that this might have been stronger if the angle from which you shot allowed only the bright overlay on the wires - the darker leftside is distracting</td>', 'I think that this might have been stronger if the angle from which you shot allowed only the bright overlay on the wires - the darker leftside is distracting', '2003-09-08 21:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
