(413645, 36841, 1041, '<td valign="top">A dandy long-legs?  Met the challenge I guess but I would like to see more than just the legs.  Focus is ok, as is the color and the unobtrusive background.  I wonder what that red spot is?</td>', 'A dandy long-legs?  Met the challenge I guess but I would like to see more than just the legs.  Focus is ok, as is the color and the unobtrusive background.  I wonder what that red spot is?', '2003-09-09 17:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(413647, 36882, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met, even though I''d prefer to see an alive rather than a drowned insect.  The biggest distraction here is all the dirt in and on top of the water.  But the fly does have a kind of cool blue color.  Never seen that before :)</td>', 'Challenge met, even though I''d prefer to see an alive rather than a drowned insect.  The biggest distraction here is all the dirt in and on top of the water.  But the fly does have a kind of cool blue color.  Never seen that before :)', '2003-09-09 17:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(413649, 36035, 6624, '<td valign="top">"I ''m not common at all...quite unique"  The leg patterns are wonderful - perhaps the shot could have pulled more of that in?</td>', '"I ''m not common at all...quite unique"  The leg patterns are wonderful - perhaps the shot could have pulled more of that in?', '2003-09-09 17:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
