(413661, 36357, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  The mantas really does blend in.  Cool that you were able to get so close, unfortunately, the fact that it is blending in hurts the photograph IMO because it''s hard to distinguish between the background and the mantas.  Technicallly, you''ve exposed the shot well, lots of light and dark that you balanced well, and it''s nice and focused.</td>', 'Challenge met.  The mantas really does blend in.  Cool that you were able to get so close, unfortunately, the fact that it is blending in hurts the photograph IMO because it''s hard to distinguish between the background and the mantas.  Technicallly, you''ve exposed the shot well, lots of light and dark that you balanced well, and it''s nice and focused.', '2003-09-09 17:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(413662, 36185, 6624, '<td valign="top">fascinating creatures these are...it would have been nice to have the whole bodybut you certainly captured that empty face and the prayers</td>', 'fascinating creatures these are...it would have been nice to have the whole bodybut you certainly captured that empty face and the prayers', '2003-09-09 17:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(413664, 36852, 1041, '<td valign="top">Creepy it is.  Plus, you meet the challenge.  Interesting format and nice that you left space to the right.  It is cropped a bit tight on the left for my liking, and overall not as sharp as I''d prefer.  Is this bug still alive?   It somehow looks dead ...</td>', 'Creepy it is.  Plus, you meet the challenge.  Interesting format and nice that you left space to the right.  It is cropped a bit tight on the left for my liking, and overall not as sharp as I''d prefer.  Is this bug still alive?   It somehow looks dead ...', '2003-09-09 17:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(413665, 36816, 6624, '<td valign="top">this is a very interesting shot that doesn''t quite make it for me - the light division is too sharp and costs a bit in focus as well as loss of detail</td>', 'this is a very interesting shot that doesn''t quite make it for me - the light division is too sharp and costs a bit in focus as well as loss of detail', '2003-09-09 17:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(413668, 36483, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured.  Did you  pluck the flower and lay it on the white bckground?  And the cicada let you do this?  Either wow, or it''s dead ;)  Nice colors, and the focus is nice and crisp where it is.  The hard thing with macros is that the DOF is so shallow and that you have to get it just in the right spot.  In this case, I believe that would''ve  been the eye, but that''s OOF.</td>', 'Nicely captured.  Did you  pluck the flower and lay it on the white bckground?  And the cicada let you do this?  Either wow, or it''s dead ;)  Nice colors, and the focus is nice and crisp where it is.  The hard thing with macros is that the DOF is so shallow and that you have to get it just in the right spot.  In this case, I believe that would''ve  been the eye, but that''s OOF.', '2003-09-09 17:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(413669, 36049, 6624, '<td valign="top">wonderful caterpillar</td>', 'wonderful caterpillar', '2003-09-09 17:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(413670, 36850, 6624, '<td valign="top">I love the end of season feel to this - very nice</td>', 'I love the end of season feel to this - very nice', '2003-09-09 18:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(413673, 36694, 6624, '<td valign="top">this is quite stunning...for me the fade into background costs too much in losing the antenna and head though</td>', 'this is quite stunning...for me the fade into background costs too much in losing the antenna and head though', '2003-09-09 18:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(413674, 36459, 8159, '<td valign="top">The DOF in this shot is spectacular. I love how the bee and the flower are nice and crisp, and the other stuff is perfectly blurred. One of my favorites this challenge.</td>', 'The DOF in this shot is spectacular. I love how the bee and the flower are nice and crisp, and the other stuff is perfectly blurred. One of my favorites this challenge.', '2003-09-09 18:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(413677, 36578, 9462, '<td valign="top">Bad Bubba! Not listening to Momma. <br/>Great shot! Really gives me the creepy crawlies.</td>', 'Bad Bubba! Not listening to Momma. Great shot! Really gives me the creepy crawlies.', '2003-09-09 18:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(413678, 36407, 1041, '<td valign="top">Captured just at the right time, this is a tough one.  Like the colors and the composition, but wish the image was larger and the focus was a bit crisper.</td>', 'Captured just at the right time, this is a tough one.  Like the colors and the composition, but wish the image was larger and the focus was a bit crisper.', '2003-09-09 18:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(413679, 36317, 8159, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot. I know how difficult it is to get large DOF on macro shots, but I think this shot would totally rock if the wings were less blurred. Great job.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot. I know how difficult it is to get large DOF on macro shots, but I think this shot would totally rock if the wings were less blurred. Great job.', '2003-09-09 18:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(413680, 36032, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met, there''s bugs in your pic.  Several even.  Personally, I think a closeup of one of them might''ve been more interesting than a straight-down shot of them sitting in the egg carton.  The shot''s also a little dark.</td>', 'Challenge met, there''s bugs in your pic.  Several even.  Personally, I think a closeup of one of them might''ve been more interesting than a straight-down shot of them sitting in the egg carton.  The shot''s also a little dark.', '2003-09-09 18:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(413682, 36575, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  I love grasshoppers, especially when it''s possible to capture them out in the open like this and not hiding behind lots of leaves or blades of grass.  Also like that much of your background is monotone so the hopper stands out more.  I guess you didn''t get a chance to move around to get a pic more from the front before he (she?) hopped away?  That always makes for a more interesting photo for me.  Also, yours is quite grainy, I wonder whether that''s because you cropped out of a large pic or a high ISO setting.</td>', 'Challenge met.  I love grasshoppers, especially when it''s possible to capture them out in the open like this and not hiding behind lots of leaves or blades of grass.  Also like that much of your background is monotone so the hopper stands out more.  I guess you didn''t get a chance to move around to get a pic more from the front before he (she?) hopped away?  That always makes for a more interesting photo for me.  Also, yours is quite grainy, I wonder whether that''s because you cropped out of a large pic or a high ISO setting.', '2003-09-09 18:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(413695, 36775, 8159, '<td valign="top">Love the composition of this shot. A tad dark perhaps, but otherwise I like it a lot!</td>', 'Love the composition of this shot. A tad dark perhaps, but otherwise I like it a lot!', '2003-09-09 18:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(413715, 36177, 8159, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition! My only comment is that I wish there was more contrast / texture detail on the bug.</td>', 'Very interesting composition! My only comment is that I wish there was more contrast / texture detail on the bug.', '2003-09-09 18:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(413718, 36873, 8159, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific composition! I love it. The blue and yellow contrast with the ladybug is outstanding. Well done.</td>', 'This is a terrific composition! I love it. The blue and yellow contrast with the ladybug is outstanding. Well done.', '2003-09-09 18:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
