(417225, 36635, 8125, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot - I like his stance in this picture.  Praying Mantis is one of my favorite bugs (the only other being ladybugs)  :-)<br/> <br/>Great capture!</td>', 'Very nice shot - I like his stance in this picture.  Praying Mantis is one of my favorite bugs (the only other being ladybugs)  :-) Great capture!', '2003-09-12 18:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
