(418489, 36875, 9441, '<td valign="top">Very stunning!!  The colors just seem to pop out!  Great macro shot....</td>', 'Very stunning!!  The colors just seem to pop out!  Great macro shot....', '2003-09-14 01:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
