(418502, 36687, 9441, '<td valign="top">What a truly wonderful angle and view of this insect!  Such a wonderful closeup!  Great shot!!  Stunning!</td>', 'What a truly wonderful angle and view of this insect!  Such a wonderful closeup!  Great shot!!  Stunning!', '2003-09-14 02:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(418504, 36771, 9441, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Great color.....soft, yet rich!!</td>', 'Beautiful!  Great color.....soft, yet rich!!', '2003-09-14 02:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(418505, 36824, 9441, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo....great color and texture!</td>', 'Interesting photo....great color and texture!', '2003-09-14 02:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(418506, 36459, 9441, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Excellent....awesome...wonderful...what else is there to say...absolutely stunning!</td>', 'Wow!  Excellent....awesome...wonderful...what else is there to say...absolutely stunning!', '2003-09-14 02:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(418507, 36775, 9441, '<td valign="top">I love this closeup.....great angle!</td>', 'I love this closeup.....great angle!', '2003-09-14 02:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(418508, 36545, 9441, '<td valign="top">Great closeup detail....wonderful colors!</td>', 'Great closeup detail....wonderful colors!', '2003-09-14 02:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(418509, 36756, 9441, '<td valign="top">Outstanding!</td>', 'Outstanding!', '2003-09-14 02:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(418510, 36806, 9441, '<td valign="top">What beautiful colors.....</td>', 'What beautiful colors.....', '2003-09-14 02:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(418533, 36843, 8860, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot. Where were these? It''s a shame about the top ant being cropped though. Nice DOF.</td>', 'Amazing shot. Where were these? It''s a shame about the top ant being cropped though. Nice DOF.', '2003-09-14 07:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(418534, 36823, 8860, '<td valign="top">Poor old fella! Lovely shot, with good use of mono and nice focus. Creates a sense of anticipation of the spider''s arrival... who''d be an insect?   : /</td>', 'Poor old fella! Lovely shot, with good use of mono and nice focus. Creates a sense of anticipation of the spider''s arrival... who''d be an insect?   : /', '2003-09-14 07:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(418535, 36809, 8860, '<td valign="top">Intriguing context. Wasp is a little soft, muted in colour and the composition is a bit too top-heavy, but it''s very unusual. What was happening here?</td>', 'Intriguing context. Wasp is a little soft, muted in colour and the composition is a bit too top-heavy, but it''s very unusual. What was happening here?', '2003-09-14 07:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(418536, 36285, 8860, '<td valign="top">Composition is a little flat and the subject too distant. Nice capture which could have been improved if you''d been lucky enough to have some low sunlight instead of what looks like an overcast day.</td>', 'Composition is a little flat and the subject too distant. Nice capture which could have been improved if you''d been lucky enough to have some low sunlight instead of what looks like an overcast day.', '2003-09-14 07:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(418537, 36652, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice composition (small but perfectly formed!). Obviously it would be nice to see it closer/larger but it''s a good shot.</td>', 'Nice composition (small but perfectly formed!). Obviously it would be nice to see it closer/larger but it''s a good shot.', '2003-09-14 07:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(418538, 36802, 8860, '<td valign="top">Ooh-er - look scary those! Where were they? Nice capture although DOF is almost too narrow but it just works OK. Good composition.</td>', 'Ooh-er - look scary those! Where were they? Nice capture although DOF is almost too narrow but it just works OK. Good composition.', '2003-09-14 07:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(418539, 36696, 8860, '<td valign="top">DOF is too narrow really. A slower shutter speed and longer exposure would help this, which is sometimes difficult where insects are concerned!</td>', 'DOF is too narrow really. A slower shutter speed and longer exposure would help this, which is sometimes difficult where insects are concerned!', '2003-09-14 07:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(418540, 36693, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very good composition and an excellent capture. Colours is a little dull though.</td>', 'Very good composition and an excellent capture. Colours is a little dull though.', '2003-09-14 07:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(418542, 36572, 8860, '<td valign="top">This definitely has a ''wow'' factor as the image reveals itself. Those wings are so striking. It''s an excellent capture, great DOF, well composed and good colour too. Sharpening has caused some ''jaggies'' but it''s probably the lesser of two evils. This deserves to do well. [9]</td>', 'This definitely has a ''wow'' factor as the image reveals itself. Those wings are so striking. It''s an excellent capture, great DOF, well composed and good colour too. Sharpening has caused some ''jaggies'' but it''s probably the lesser of two evils. This deserves to do well. [9]', '2003-09-14 07:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(418544, 36780, 8860, '<td valign="top">I love insects but I''ve never seen this one before! What an amazing thing - what is it - a wasp/hornet/hoverfly/bee? Great colours and composition. [8]</td>', 'I love insects but I''ve never seen this one before! What an amazing thing - what is it - a wasp/hornet/hoverfly/bee? Great colours and composition. [8]', '2003-09-14 07:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(418546, 36857, 8860, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Lesser-spotted Horse Mantis to me! Great capture - did it stay still for long?  ;D</td>', 'Looks like a Lesser-spotted Horse Mantis to me! Great capture - did it stay still for long?  ;D', '2003-09-14 07:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(418547, 36754, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great, artistic composition here with the nicely arranged foliage. Fernando looks like a fine locust indeed. Great focus and DOF - should do well. [9]</td>', 'Great, artistic composition here with the nicely arranged foliage. Fernando looks like a fine locust indeed. Great focus and DOF - should do well. [9]', '2003-09-14 07:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(418549, 36717, 8860, '<td valign="top">He obviously stayed still long enough for this!</td>', 'He obviously stayed still long enough for this!', '2003-09-14 07:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(418550, 36535, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice contextual shot. These harvestman spiders fascinate me - they always seem so fragile and humble.</td>', 'Nice contextual shot. These harvestman spiders fascinate me - they always seem so fragile and humble.', '2003-09-14 07:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(418553, 36296, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and composition. Very clean, crisp shot. [8]</td>', 'Nice detail and composition. Very clean, crisp shot. [8]', '2003-09-14 07:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(418554, 36547, 8860, '<td valign="top">That does look like a smile! :D  Good capture - overexposed branch is distracting.</td>', 'That does look like a smile! :D  Good capture - overexposed branch is distracting.', '2003-09-14 07:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(418556, 36800, 8860, '<td valign="top">I have to make the assumption that he is some kind of biologist, but it does nothing for me really since there is nothing obviously relevant to his trade in the shot. Even as a portrait this doesn''t tell me much. The composition is too centralised and the context of the shot too busy.</td>', 'I have to make the assumption that he is some kind of biologist, but it does nothing for me really since there is nothing obviously relevant to his trade in the shot. Even as a portrait this doesn''t tell me much. The composition is too centralised and the context of the shot too busy.', '2003-09-14 07:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(418557, 36317, 8860, '<td valign="top">Like the design in this shot. Overexposure works with good DOF.</td>', 'Like the design in this shot. Overexposure works with good DOF.', '2003-09-14 07:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(418651, 36846, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty. The damsel''s head is a little lost in the dark part of the background, though. Pretty good DOF and nice focus. Wings are in an attractive position. Overall, good catch just slightly let down by the viewpoint.</td>', 'Pretty. The damsel''s head is a little lost in the dark part of the background, though. Pretty good DOF and nice focus. Wings are in an attractive position. Overall, good catch just slightly let down by the viewpoint.', '2003-09-14 13:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(418653, 36435, 3290, '<td valign="top">Potentially nice shot. Looks like it was spoiled by camera shake. If it''s too dull to get a high shutter speed, I find using a flash helps.</td>', 'Potentially nice shot. Looks like it was spoiled by camera shake. If it''s too dull to get a high shutter speed, I find using a flash helps.', '2003-09-14 13:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(418654, 36826, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting, almost abstract shot. Bit different from the usual ''documentary'' shots. Like the ''greenness'' of it. Well done.</td>', 'Interesting, almost abstract shot. Bit different from the usual ''documentary'' shots. Like the ''greenness'' of it. Well done.', '2003-09-14 13:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(418655, 36530, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice and close. Good exposure ans a nice composition. Just let down by lack of sharpness. As it seems to be all over, I''d suspect camera shake.</td>', 'Nice and close. Good exposure ans a nice composition. Just let down by lack of sharpness. As it seems to be all over, I''d suspect camera shake.', '2003-09-14 13:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(418656, 36779, 3290, '<td valign="top">Creepy. Good close-up detail but couls use a bit more light. I like the effect created by the ''forest'' of legs. Not sure about the red background, though.</td>', 'Creepy. Good close-up detail but couls use a bit more light. I like the effect created by the ''forest'' of legs. Not sure about the red background, though.', '2003-09-14 13:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(418657, 36754, 11873, '<td valign="top">Well, this is one of the best I''ve seen in here so far, but for me grasshoppers aren''t a very challenging or interesting subject to photograph.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-09-15 12:30:24.</i></td>', 'Well, this is one of the best I''ve seen in here so far, but for me grasshoppers aren''t a very challenging or interesting subject to photograph.', '2003-09-14 13:18:34.000000', '2003-09-15 13:30:24.000000', 1),
(418658, 36871, 3290, '<td valign="top">What a great subject and in a lovely pose. The only problem is that the brightness of the background is a bit overpowering and puts the butterfly in the shade. Nice detail on the wings.</td>', 'What a great subject and in a lovely pose. The only problem is that the brightness of the background is a bit overpowering and puts the butterfly in the shade. Nice detail on the wings.', '2003-09-14 13:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(418661, 36607, 3290, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a wasp. Whatever, this is perhaps the first time I''ve felt sorry for one of the little stingers! Good interest shot. Ideally, would have a tad more sharpness and be a bit more brightly lit.</td>', 'Looks more like a wasp. Whatever, this is perhaps the first time I''ve felt sorry for one of the little stingers! Good interest shot. Ideally, would have a tad more sharpness and be a bit more brightly lit.', '2003-09-14 13:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(418662, 36872, 3290, '<td valign="top">Very nice colours. The dark background is ideal for making the subject stand out. You''ve got a dilemma, though - concentrate on the butterfly or include more of the flower. I think I''d have cropped a bit more of the flower out. The picture''s a little unbalanced - everything''s over on the left. I think a rotation about 15 degrees counter-clockwise would sort this out.</td>', 'Very nice colours. The dark background is ideal for making the subject stand out. You''ve got a dilemma, though - concentrate on the butterfly or include more of the flower. I think I''d have cropped a bit more of the flower out. The picture''s a little unbalanced - everything''s over on the left. I think a rotation about 15 degrees counter-clockwise would sort this out.', '2003-09-14 13:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(418664, 36758, 3290, '<td valign="top">I think this is a Forest Bug (Pentatoma rufipes), as Hawthorn Shield Bugs (Acanthosoma haemorrhoidale) are predominantly green. Nice shot, but shame you didn''t catch him on a nice green leaf for contrast. Looks like good detail, but why not crop some of the ''empty'' space to left and right and have the subject occupy more of the shot?</td>', 'I think this is a Forest Bug (Pentatoma rufipes), as Hawthorn Shield Bugs (Acanthosoma haemorrhoidale) are predominantly green. Nice shot, but shame you didn''t catch him on a nice green leaf for contrast. Looks like good detail, but why not crop some of the ''empty'' space to left and right and have the subject occupy more of the shot?', '2003-09-14 13:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(418666, 36410, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good subject. Sharpness looks good on the head, but I''d like to see that not quite so close to the edge of the shot. As it is, my eye naturally falls on the rear leg, which isn''t quite sharp.</td>', 'Good subject. Sharpness looks good on the head, but I''d like to see that not quite so close to the edge of the shot. As it is, my eye naturally falls on the rear leg, which isn''t quite sharp.', '2003-09-14 13:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(418667, 36471, 3290, '<td valign="top">Wow! Creepy - what a monster. Glad we don''t get those in our garden.</td>', 'Wow! Creepy - what a monster. Glad we don''t get those in our garden.', '2003-09-14 13:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(418668, 36749, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Good composition and pleasant colours. Looks like the head could be a just a bit sharper, though. Difficult one to get the exposure right on, as the insect''s head is much darker than the flower.</td>', 'Nice shot. Good composition and pleasant colours. Looks like the head could be a just a bit sharper, though. Difficult one to get the exposure right on, as the insect''s head is much darker than the flower.', '2003-09-14 13:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(418669, 36778, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice catch - must have used a high shutter speed to freeze the wings like that. Ironically, might have been more impressive to get a bit of motion in the wings, to show that it''s flying and not landed</td>', 'Nice catch - must have used a high shutter speed to freeze the wings like that. Ironically, might have been more impressive to get a bit of motion in the wings, to show that it''s flying and not landed', '2003-09-14 13:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(418673, 36459, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting. The ''flat'' effect on the central areas of the flower petals looks like soft focus but I think you''ve used Neat Image or a similar tool to remove a lot of the noise. If so - it''s removed some of the detail too. There''s a also a fringe around the petals which suggests a bit too much sharpening. Having said that, I quite like the effect, even though it looks a bit unnatural.</td>', 'Interesting. The ''flat'' effect on the central areas of the flower petals looks like soft focus but I think you''ve used Neat Image or a similar tool to remove a lot of the noise. If so - it''s removed some of the detail too. There''s a also a fringe around the petals which suggests a bit too much sharpening. Having said that, I quite like the effect, even though it looks a bit unnatural.', '2003-09-14 13:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(418674, 36756, 3290, '<td valign="top">Antenna is nice and sharp, as are the leaves, but the eyes aren''t unfortunately which lessens the impact of the shot. Interesting composition, though.</td>', 'Antenna is nice and sharp, as are the leaves, but the eyes aren''t unfortunately which lessens the impact of the shot. Interesting composition, though.', '2003-09-14 13:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(418675, 36876, 3290, '<td valign="top">I like the backlit effect, but the out of focus leaf is a distraction. Good sharpness and detail on the ''hopper.</td>', 'I like the backlit effect, but the out of focus leaf is a distraction. Good sharpness and detail on the ''hopper.', '2003-09-14 13:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(418676, 36873, 3290, '<td valign="top">This is very nice - great colours and composition. I think this will do well - a very attractive shot. Well done.</td>', 'This is very nice - great colours and composition. I think this will do well - a very attractive shot. Well done.', '2003-09-14 13:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(418677, 36754, 3290, '<td valign="top">Simple, sharp effective. A very nice shot. Perhaps a little more light on the hopper''s flank - it seems a tad dark around the eye. Nice job.</td>', 'Simple, sharp effective. A very nice shot. Perhaps a little more light on the hopper''s flank - it seems a tad dark around the eye. Nice job.', '2003-09-14 13:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(418679, 36832, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great subject and a good pose, but really needs more DOF, especially on those forelegs. Might have had more impact with a tighter crop on the head. I like the orange/green background.</td>', 'Great subject and a good pose, but really needs more DOF, especially on those forelegs. Might have had more impact with a tighter crop on the head. I like the orange/green background.', '2003-09-14 13:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(418703, 36317, 11873, '<td valign="top">Great subject and angle/composition. The white background and lighting don''t look natural, though. Taken in the studio? Deeper depth of field that includes more of the wings would be an improvement, in my opinion. Specks on the leaf are reasons that I disagree with the "no spot retouching" rule. I think we should be able to eliminate those kind of imperfections. The one on the bottom appears to be a bad pixel.</td>', 'Great subject and angle/composition. The white background and lighting don''t look natural, though. Taken in the studio? Deeper depth of field that includes more of the wings would be an improvement, in my opinion. Specks on the leaf are reasons that I disagree with the "no spot retouching" rule. I think we should be able to eliminate those kind of imperfections. The one on the bottom appears to be a bad pixel.', '2003-09-14 14:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(418704, 36496, 11873, '<td valign="top">It looks like the camera was hand held with too low of a shutter speed, and to make up for it, the image was sharpened. Color tone is a little bit too blue/magenta.</td>', 'It looks like the camera was hand held with too low of a shutter speed, and to make up for it, the image was sharpened. Color tone is a little bit too blue/magenta.', '2003-09-14 14:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(418705, 36049, 11873, '<td valign="top">It seems to me that if you were already this close, you could have gotten a little closer and more intimate. A lower angle would be an improvement. The subject is too much in the middle. It looks like it was taken as a snapshot, rather than a carefully composed image.</td>', 'It seems to me that if you were already this close, you could have gotten a little closer and more intimate. A lower angle would be an improvement. The subject is too much in the middle. It looks like it was taken as a snapshot, rather than a carefully composed image.', '2003-09-14 14:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(418707, 36086, 11873, '<td valign="top">I doubt that I''m the only one to say this: that there is a lot of wasted image space. It''s a butt-shot; we want to see the bees face, unless we''re getting intimate with it''s butt...</td>', 'I doubt that I''m the only one to say this: that there is a lot of wasted image space. It''s a butt-shot; we want to see the bees face, unless we''re getting intimate with it''s butt...', '2003-09-14 14:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(418708, 36483, 11873, '<td valign="top">The most important part of any subject is what? The EYES. Here they are out of focus. It doesn''t look like a cicada in its natural habitat.</td>', 'The most important part of any subject is what? The EYES. Here they are out of focus. It doesn''t look like a cicada in its natural habitat.', '2003-09-14 14:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(418709, 36725, 11873, '<td valign="top">I can just barely make out that it is an Argiope aurantia or Yellow Garden Spider. The image looks like a snapshot and not very carefully composed. Get closer, much closer! Don''t worry, it won''t jump off of its web and bite you. The highlights are blown out and the image fidelity is very low, in other words, there isn''t a very wide range of tones from light to dark, like the greyscale bar below. The white line on the bottom should have been cropped off.</td>', 'I can just barely make out that it is an Argiope aurantia or Yellow Garden Spider. The image looks like a snapshot and not very carefully composed. Get closer, much closer! Don''t worry, it won''t jump off of its web and bite you. The highlights are blown out and the image fidelity is very low, in other words, there isn''t a very wide range of tones from light to dark, like the greyscale bar below. The white line on the bottom should have been cropped off.', '2003-09-14 15:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(418714, 36745, 11873, '<td valign="top">Not the worst that I have seen, but it''s a butt shot. By the way, spiders are arachnids, not insects. If I were trying to get a good shot of this spider, however, I would get in front of it rather than "behind" it. The man-made and unnatural roof background detracts from the subject.</td>', 'Not the worst that I have seen, but it''s a butt shot. By the way, spiders are arachnids, not insects. If I were trying to get a good shot of this spider, however, I would get in front of it rather than "behind" it. The man-made and unnatural roof background detracts from the subject.', '2003-09-14 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(418715, 36652, 11873, '<td valign="top">First of all, I have two words for you: TOO SMALL. This is barely a thumbnail image. If I were taken a picture of this katydid, I would go around carefully to the other side of the fence, in FRONT of the insect and get closer. It looks too much like the insect is getting away from us, rather than getting intimate with us.</td>', 'First of all, I have two words for you: TOO SMALL. This is barely a thumbnail image. If I were taken a picture of this katydid, I would go around carefully to the other side of the fence, in FRONT of the insect and get closer. It looks too much like the insect is getting away from us, rather than getting intimate with us.', '2003-09-14 15:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(418717, 36850, 11873, '<td valign="top">The camera angle is awkward. Moving down and in front of the insect would have been a huge improvement.</td>', 'The camera angle is awkward. Moving down and in front of the insect would have been a huge improvement.', '2003-09-14 15:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(418719, 36879, 11873, '<td valign="top">Out of focus. Sorry, but sharpening can''t correct what isn''t already there. You need to focus on the most important part of any subject: the EYES. Very lacking in color fidelity. Compare the grey scale below to your image; there is no tonal range. Damselfly is a good subject, though.</td>', 'Out of focus. Sorry, but sharpening can''t correct what isn''t already there. You need to focus on the most important part of any subject: the EYES. Very lacking in color fidelity. Compare the grey scale below to your image; there is no tonal range. Damselfly is a good subject, though.', '2003-09-14 15:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(418722, 36796, 11873, '<td valign="top">How can we get intimate with a dead wasp?</td>', 'How can we get intimate with a dead wasp?', '2003-09-14 15:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(418723, 36696, 11873, '<td valign="top">Depth of field is too shallow. Eyes aren''t entirely sharp and in-focus.</td>', 'Depth of field is too shallow. Eyes aren''t entirely sharp and in-focus.', '2003-09-14 15:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(418731, 36177, 1176, '<td valign="top">Nope</td>', 'Nope', '2003-09-14 16:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(418732, 36873, 1176, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors</td>', 'Stunning colors', '2003-09-14 16:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(418751, 36784, 10402, '<td valign="top">The backlighting really shows off the patterns in this guy''s wings. Great focus.</td>', 'The backlighting really shows off the patterns in this guy''s wings. Great focus.', '2003-09-14 17:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(418752, 36527, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great composition; you''ve included just enough of the insect''s body to provide context, and enough space at the right for balance.</td>', 'Great composition; you''ve included just enough of the insect''s body to provide context, and enough space at the right for balance.', '2003-09-14 17:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(418754, 36470, 10402, '<td valign="top">A bit more DOF would have been nice to get the wing tips in focus, but this is a great insect portrait. Lots of detail and well balanced.</td>', 'A bit more DOF would have been nice to get the wing tips in focus, but this is a great insect portrait. Lots of detail and well balanced.', '2003-09-14 17:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(418758, 36824, 472, '<td valign="top">incredible colors and detail</td>', 'incredible colors and detail', '2003-09-14 17:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(418760, 36754, 10402, '<td valign="top">The challenge did say to get intimate, and giving this insect a name certainly shows you did that! But so does the photo; the composition is nicely balanced and the major lines in the image (focused grass blade, antennae, and wings to name a few) all lead the viewer''s eye to insect''s head, which is well focused. It let''s the viewers get as intimate with this critter as you did.</td>', 'The challenge did say to get intimate, and giving this insect a name certainly shows you did that! But so does the photo; the composition is nicely balanced and the major lines in the image (focused grass blade, antennae, and wings to name a few) all lead the viewer''s eye to insect''s head, which is well focused. It let''s the viewers get as intimate with this critter as you did.', '2003-09-14 17:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(418764, 36763, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the metallic colors of this insect. I think you got the lighting perfect; the shadow contributes to the interest of this image. The jagged leaf edge with emptyness to the right makes a great composition. The title fits well.</td>', 'Great capture of the metallic colors of this insect. I think you got the lighting perfect; the shadow contributes to the interest of this image. The jagged leaf edge with emptyness to the right makes a great composition. The title fits well.', '2003-09-14 17:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(418770, 36742, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good focus and nice use of negative space. This image defies conventional wisdom that dictates putting more space in front of the subject than behind it, but I think it works well. Perhaps due to the shape of the leaf. But I don''t think the photo would be nearly as effective without all that space behind the fly. The drop of liquid adds a nice touch.</td>', 'Good focus and nice use of negative space. This image defies conventional wisdom that dictates putting more space in front of the subject than behind it, but I think it works well. Perhaps due to the shape of the leaf. But I don''t think the photo would be nearly as effective without all that space behind the fly. The drop of liquid adds a nice touch.', '2003-09-14 17:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(418773, 36429, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great lighting here; it highlights the spider very well and shows off her web.</td>', 'Great lighting here; it highlights the spider very well and shows off her web.', '2003-09-14 17:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(418780, 36477, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this photo. The lines formed by the top of the rock and by the backs of three ladybugs in the foreground lead the eye to the main point of interest, the bug about to take off. A bit more space at the top would have improved the photo.</td>', 'I like the composition of this photo. The lines formed by the top of the rock and by the backs of three ladybugs in the foreground lead the eye to the main point of interest, the bug about to take off. A bit more space at the top would have improved the photo.', '2003-09-14 18:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(418781, 36020, 10402, '<td valign="top">Wow! Talk about getting intimate! Great composition here. It needs a little more DOF to get the hairs on the mouth and upper legs in focus.</td>', 'Wow! Talk about getting intimate! Great composition here. It needs a little more DOF to get the hairs on the mouth and upper legs in focus.', '2003-09-14 18:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(418786, 36471, 10402, '<td valign="top">The glare is a bit distracting, but this is a nice detailed image of an unusual insect. I like the wood it is on and the unfocused leaf in the background.</td>', 'The glare is a bit distracting, but this is a nice detailed image of an unusual insect. I like the wood it is on and the unfocused leaf in the background.', '2003-09-14 18:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(418792, 36446, 10402, '<td valign="top">Creative idea and great focus. But the background is too distracting; there is nothing to draw attention to the bug. And the subject is looking out of the frame, so it kind of feels cut off.</td>', 'Creative idea and great focus. But the background is too distracting; there is nothing to draw attention to the bug. And the subject is looking out of the frame, so it kind of feels cut off.', '2003-09-14 18:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(418798, 36575, 10402, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and setting. A bit more space at the top and right would improve the composition. And it really needs some post-processing to reduce the noise, increase the contrast, and correct the color cast.</td>', 'Interesting subject and setting. A bit more space at the top and right would improve the composition. And it really needs some post-processing to reduce the noise, increase the contrast, and correct the color cast.', '2003-09-14 18:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(418800, 36851, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and lighting (and great title). Needs more DOF, or at least for the focus to be on the mantis'' head.</td>', 'Nice composition and lighting (and great title). Needs more DOF, or at least for the focus to be on the mantis'' head.', '2003-09-14 18:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(418802, 36687, 10402, '<td valign="top">Very creative and effective angle. The focus on the head is great. I wish the DOF was greater; having the wings out of focus makes them seem detached from the butterfly.</td>', 'Very creative and effective angle. The focus on the head is great. I wish the DOF was greater; having the wings out of focus makes them seem detached from the butterfly.', '2003-09-14 19:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(418803, 36778, 10510, '<td valign="top">Is this a hummingbird moth?  I''ve seen some in my garden and their wings are fluttering like a humminbird''s.  I''m surprised that you captured such stillness.  Great shot and beautiful colors.</td>', 'Is this a hummingbird moth?  I''ve seen some in my garden and their wings are fluttering like a humminbird''s.  I''m surprised that you captured such stillness.  Great shot and beautiful colors.', '2003-09-14 19:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(418804, 36604, 10510, '<td valign="top">They look so cute from far away!</td>', 'They look so cute from far away!', '2003-09-14 19:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(418805, 36697, 10510, '<td valign="top">Yuk.  Great shot!</td>', 'Yuk.  Great shot!', '2003-09-14 19:10:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(418806, 36754, 10510, '<td valign="top">Great picture!  I can''t get this close with my camera, dang it.</td>', 'Great picture!  I can''t get this close with my camera, dang it.', '2003-09-14 19:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(418808, 36874, 10510, '<td valign="top">This one has got to be in at least the top ten!</td>', 'This one has got to be in at least the top ten!', '2003-09-14 19:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(418809, 36410, 10510, '<td valign="top">Katie did the top 10 for sure.</td>', 'Katie did the top 10 for sure.', '2003-09-14 19:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(418811, 36745, 10510, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I would rather see a spider going away than coming towards me.</td>', 'Great shot.  I would rather see a spider going away than coming towards me.', '2003-09-14 19:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(418813, 36872, 10510, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful.', '2003-09-14 19:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(418815, 36880, 10510, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2003-09-14 19:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(418817, 36804, 10510, '<td valign="top">Very funny!</td>', 'Very funny!', '2003-09-14 19:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(418818, 36547, 10510, '<td valign="top">It is smiling!  I''ve seen a few other photos on here that captured an almost human (although ugly) face.  Great photo.</td>', 'It is smiling!  I''ve seen a few other photos on here that captured an almost human (although ugly) face.  Great photo.', '2003-09-14 19:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(418819, 36545, 10510, '<td valign="top">Beautiful crisp colors.  10</td>', 'Beautiful crisp colors.  10', '2003-09-14 19:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(418820, 36635, 10510, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking top 10 for this oone.</td>', 'I''m thinking top 10 for this oone.', '2003-09-14 19:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(418821, 36292, 10510, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites!  This is a great shot and also a well done spoof on all the forums about "outside the box".  I like to think that my photos are outside the box too.  They don''t win me any prizes, but I think this one will win you one.  10</td>', 'One of my favorites!  This is a great shot and also a well done spoof on all the forums about "outside the box".  I like to think that my photos are outside the box too.  They don''t win me any prizes, but I think this one will win you one.  10', '2003-09-14 19:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(418822, 36821, 10510, '<td valign="top">Gross, but one of the best.</td>', 'Gross, but one of the best.', '2003-09-14 19:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(418823, 36301, 10510, '<td valign="top">Is it really this color, and what is it?</td>', 'Is it really this color, and what is it?', '2003-09-14 19:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(418824, 36758, 10510, '<td valign="top">Weird bug!  He must not worry about camoflage with those bright orange legs.</td>', 'Weird bug!  He must not worry about camoflage with those bright orange legs.', '2003-09-14 19:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(418826, 36841, 10510, '<td valign="top">Okay, if this does not get a ribbon I will be surprised.  It will be added to my favorites for sure.  10</td>', 'Okay, if this does not get a ribbon I will be surprised.  It will be added to my favorites for sure.  10', '2003-09-14 19:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(418827, 36169, 10510, '<td valign="top">Great colors!</td>', 'Great colors!', '2003-09-14 19:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(418829, 36756, 10510, '<td valign="top">Scary!  Wonderful shot.</td>', 'Scary!  Wonderful shot.', '2003-09-14 19:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(418830, 36020, 7778, '<td valign="top">If eyes are -windows of the soul-, I wouldn''t want to be this one''s analyst... ;-)<br/> <br/>What an amazing and extreme macro! The proximity to the subject is so microscopic, the DOF is beginning to feel almost too shallow. Given the sheer size of the magnified and central point of focus, I feel, a somewhat more generous crop at the top of the image (if possible) could provide both a balance for the wide diagonal (white mesh) at the bottom and a more standard vertical format, without sacrificing the present impact.<br/> <br/>On a marginal note, the border appears -a little- too decorative, perhaps, for such a bold capture.<br/>Nevertheless, one of the very best shots here, IMO, with an expanse of detail and plenty of -wow-!</td>', 'If eyes are -windows of the soul-, I wouldn''t want to be this one''s analyst... ;-) What an amazing and extreme macro! The proximity to the subject is so microscopic, the DOF is beginning to feel almost too shallow. Given the sheer size of the magnified and central point of focus, I feel, a somewhat more generous crop at the top of the image (if possible) could provide both a balance for the wide diagonal (white mesh) at the bottom and a more standard vertical format, without sacrificing the present impact. On a marginal note, the border appears -a little- too decorative, perhaps, for such a bold capture.Nevertheless, one of the very best shots here, IMO, with an expanse of detail and plenty of -wow-!', '2003-09-14 19:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(418833, 36851, 10510, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it strage how they look at you and like they can hear you?  Or would it rather eat you than the bug?  One of my favorites!  Maybe a little out of focus, but still a great picture.</td>', 'Isn''t it strage how they look at you and like they can hear you?  Or would it rather eat you than the bug?  One of my favorites!  Maybe a little out of focus, but still a great picture.', '2003-09-14 19:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(418835, 36824, 10510, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  Weird bug, do you know what it is?</td>', 'Great colors.  Weird bug, do you know what it is?', '2003-09-14 19:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(418838, 36203, 10510, '<td valign="top">This one is almoost too scary look at to vote on, but it is such a great picture that I decided to give it a 10.</td>', 'This one is almoost too scary look at to vote on, but it is such a great picture that I decided to give it a 10.', '2003-09-14 19:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(418840, 36818, 10510, '<td valign="top">I don''t like spideers, but this is a fascinating picture.  Is it a wolf spider?</td>', 'I don''t like spideers, but this is a fascinating picture.  Is it a wolf spider?', '2003-09-14 19:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(418841, 36768, 7778, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous rendering, technically proficient, a feast of an image! The folded wings vs. the rotundity of the petal, the repetition of warm tones between subject and habitat (the blurred -blotch-, the washed yellows) make for an unusual and striking aesthetic and natural composition. <br/> <br/>The lack of a decorative border, especially, is a very fine distinction.</td>', 'A gorgeous rendering, technically proficient, a feast of an image! The folded wings vs. the rotundity of the petal, the repetition of warm tones between subject and habitat (the blurred -blotch-, the washed yellows) make for an unusual and striking aesthetic and natural composition.  The lack of a decorative border, especially, is a very fine distinction.', '2003-09-14 19:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(418842, 36446, 10510, '<td valign="top">Very clever.</td>', 'Very clever.', '2003-09-14 19:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(418849, 36459, 7778, '<td valign="top">If I strained to find one thing to improve on with this incredibly crisp and gorgeous image, I''d (humbly) ask to consider the minimal hairline black applied to all borderless images here by default. I do not believe, anything at all could make this exceptional image more than it is.<br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'If I strained to find one thing to improve on with this incredibly crisp and gorgeous image, I''d (humbly) ask to consider the minimal hairline black applied to all borderless images here by default. I do not believe, anything at all could make this exceptional image more than it is.  ', '2003-09-14 20:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(418865, 36020, 6458, '<td valign="top">Hey baby! You have great eyes! Wanna come back to my place?</td>', 'Hey baby! You have great eyes! Wanna come back to my place?', '2003-09-14 21:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(418873, 36678, 7703, '<td valign="top">Not in focus and the ant (??) is suposed to be the main subject ... you have to find the insect in the picture ... -3</td>', 'Not in focus and the ant (??) is suposed to be the main subject ... you have to find the insect in the picture ... -3', '2003-09-14 21:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(418874, 36032, 7703, '<td valign="top">I''m glad I live in Iceland and don''t have insects like this one.</td>', 'I''m glad I live in Iceland and don''t have insects like this one.', '2003-09-14 21:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(418875, 36873, 7703, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite this week. The Colors fits so well to gether -10</td>', 'This is one of my favorite this week. The Colors fits so well to gether -10', '2003-09-14 21:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(418876, 36292, 7703, '<td valign="top">I like this picture and the title but the border is something that you don''t need for this picture. -7</td>', 'I like this picture and the title but the border is something that you don''t need for this picture. -7', '2003-09-14 21:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(418905, 36203, 772, '<td valign="top">This is excellent.. very sharp and nice composition as well... = 10</td>', 'This is excellent.. very sharp and nice composition as well... = 10', '2003-09-14 23:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(418907, 36317, 6870, '<td valign="top">The sharp image and the white background reallymake this shot stand out. 10</td>', 'The sharp image and the white background reallymake this shot stand out. 10', '2003-09-14 23:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(418908, 36823, 6870, '<td valign="top">Water droplets and rule of thirds make this photo really stark and nice. The rule of thirds lets us know that there''s a spider around somewhere. It the bug were centered, it would not be so. 10</td>', 'Water droplets and rule of thirds make this photo really stark and nice. The rule of thirds lets us know that there''s a spider around somewhere. It the bug were centered, it would not be so. 10', '2003-09-14 23:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(418909, 36871, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice Aristotelian title. Sharp focus and DOF really help here.9</td>', 'Nice Aristotelian title. Sharp focus and DOF really help here.9', '2003-09-14 23:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(418910, 36866, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the delicate wings, made more so by the duotone. 9</td>', 'I love the delicate wings, made more so by the duotone. 9', '2003-09-14 23:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(418911, 36768, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is a unique angle for a butterly shot. Nice rich colors and good choice of focus.</td>', 'This is a unique angle for a butterly shot. Nice rich colors and good choice of focus.', '2003-09-14 23:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(418912, 36841, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Great contrasts and lovely DOF. 9</td>', 'Very nice! Great contrasts and lovely DOF. 9', '2003-09-14 23:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(418913, 36446, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever idea to be sure, but the focus and contrasts are also good. 9</td>', 'Clever idea to be sure, but the focus and contrasts are also good. 9', '2003-09-14 23:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(418914, 36826, 6870, '<td valign="top">INteresting lines and sillhouette here. Lighting and focus are verynice. 9</td>', 'INteresting lines and sillhouette here. Lighting and focus are verynice. 9', '2003-09-14 23:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(418915, 36694, 6870, '<td valign="top">I can''t complain too much about this shot--especially the lovely colors contrasting the wings.</td>', 'I can''t complain too much about this shot--especially the lovely colors contrasting the wings.', '2003-09-14 23:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(418917, 36884, 11873, '<td valign="top">How is this getting intimate? It''s dead, deceased, history, it''s an ex-bug, it''s no longer with us.</td>', 'How is this getting intimate? It''s dead, deceased, history, it''s an ex-bug, it''s no longer with us.', '2003-09-14 23:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(418918, 36816, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like your idea here and how the insect mimics the duotone wooden background.</td>', 'I like your idea here and how the insect mimics the duotone wooden background.', '2003-09-14 23:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(418919, 36687, 11873, '<td valign="top">Looks like it was taken hand held with slightly too low of a shutter speed and then sharpened to try and make up for it.</td>', 'Looks like it was taken hand held with slightly too low of a shutter speed and then sharpened to try and make up for it.', '2003-09-14 23:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(418920, 36032, 6870, '<td valign="top">Tasty treats for some lizard no doubt? Nice lighting, and the patterns created by the eggshell-like carton are interesting. Perhaps more contrast or more stark lighting would add even more interest to this photo.</td>', 'Tasty treats for some lizard no doubt? Nice lighting, and the patterns created by the eggshell-like carton are interesting. Perhaps more contrast or more stark lighting would add even more interest to this photo.', '2003-09-14 23:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(418922, 36435, 6870, '<td valign="top">Okay, out of focus, sure, but the composition and lighting--especially on that left wing are so fabulous. Background is nice and unobtrusive.</td>', 'Okay, out of focus, sure, but the composition and lighting--especially on that left wing are so fabulous. Background is nice and unobtrusive.', '2003-09-14 23:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(418923, 36728, 6870, '<td valign="top">The grim forces of nature at work! Spooky. I wish the moth were more clear, in relation to yoru title. Background is nicely unobtrusive.</td>', 'The grim forces of nature at work! Spooky. I wish the moth were more clear, in relation to yoru title. Background is nicely unobtrusive.', '2003-09-14 23:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(418924, 36578, 11873, '<td valign="top">Not too bad, although it was obviously taken in captivity and doesn''t look natural at all. One other problem; there''s no way I''m going to give a good rating to a spider when the challenge is titled "INSECTS". A spider is an arachnid, and anyone who tries to pass one off as an insect deserves to lose points.</td>', 'Not too bad, although it was obviously taken in captivity and doesn''t look natural at all. One other problem; there''s no way I''m going to give a good rating to a spider when the challenge is titled "INSECTS". A spider is an arachnid, and anyone who tries to pass one off as an insect deserves to lose points.', '2003-09-14 23:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(418925, 36829, 6870, '<td valign="top">What stunning wings! And the lines you''ve used really work for me here. Lighting seems just a tad bright, but nice photo. Have you tried placing this insect in one of the thirds? It might indicate its environment more, which would echo your use of line.</td>', 'What stunning wings! And the lines you''ve used really work for me here. Lighting seems just a tad bright, but nice photo. Have you tried placing this insect in one of the thirds? It might indicate its environment more, which would echo your use of line.', '2003-09-14 23:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(418927, 36604, 6870, '<td valign="top">Talk about Macro! This one is really close, and that''s fun. The photo lacks super clarity, but it certainly has some drama!</td>', 'Talk about Macro! This one is really close, and that''s fun. The photo lacks super clarity, but it certainly has some drama!', '2003-09-14 23:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(418928, 36775, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot... amazing actually.. = 10</td>', 'beautiful shot... amazing actually.. = 10', '2003-09-14 23:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(418929, 36529, 11873, '<td valign="top">Great photo of a grasshopper. I''ve found grasshoppers to be rather easy subjects and not very challenging.</td>', 'Great photo of a grasshopper. I''ve found grasshoppers to be rather easy subjects and not very challenging.', '2003-09-14 23:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(418931, 36717, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like how the pewter bug''s tones match so well the tones of the leaves around it. Had you used the rule of thirds here, it would have gone far in implying the world around the bug, and enhance the illusion that this bug actually belongs here.</td>', 'I like how the pewter bug''s tones match so well the tones of the leaves around it. Had you used the rule of thirds here, it would have gone far in implying the world around the bug, and enhance the illusion that this bug actually belongs here.', '2003-09-14 23:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(418933, 36242, 6870, '<td valign="top">Your black background makes this look like an alien on another planet. Cool. I wish the bug were more in focus or was clearer in some way, though. Super use of contrasts and light.</td>', 'Your black background makes this look like an alien on another planet. Cool. I wish the bug were more in focus or was clearer in some way, though. Super use of contrasts and light.', '2003-09-14 23:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(418934, 36867, 11873, '<td valign="top">The bee suffers from motion blur due to a shutter speed too slow to freeze motion. It would also be a more powerful bee image if the flower was mostly cropped out. I can tell that this image was over-sharpened to try to compensate for the blur.</td>', 'The bee suffers from motion blur due to a shutter speed too slow to freeze motion. It would also be a more powerful bee image if the flower was mostly cropped out. I can tell that this image was over-sharpened to try to compensate for the blur.', '2003-09-14 23:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(418937, 36882, 11873, '<td valign="top">How is this intimate? It''s dead, deceased, an ex-bluefly, no longer with us! That bird bath is pretty gross-looking; no wonder the fly died.</td>', 'How is this intimate? It''s dead, deceased, an ex-bluefly, no longer with us! That bird bath is pretty gross-looking; no wonder the fly died.', '2003-09-14 23:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(418942, 36785, 11873, '<td valign="top">Very similar to some images of my own, but not ones that I like. I don''t think that dragonflies look very good with their wings in that position. Wait for it to take off and land in that spot again with its wings out and you''ll get a much better image. This species has very striking thorax coloration, but it''s covered up by the wings. It''s got that "droopy" look.</td>', 'Very similar to some images of my own, but not ones that I like. I don''t think that dragonflies look very good with their wings in that position. Wait for it to take off and land in that spot again with its wings out and you''ll get a much better image. This species has very striking thorax coloration, but it''s covered up by the wings. It''s got that "droopy" look.', '2003-09-14 23:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(418945, 36776, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow that is VERY cool.  What kind of mirror is that?  Great how it makes the Mantis look bigger.</td>', 'Wow that is VERY cool.  What kind of mirror is that?  Great how it makes the Mantis look bigger.', '2003-09-14 23:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(418946, 36697, 5705, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool-- 8</td>', 'Pretty cool-- 8', '2003-09-14 23:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(418947, 36809, 5705, '<td valign="top">A little too soft</td>', 'A little too soft', '2003-09-14 23:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(418949, 36843, 5705, '<td valign="top">thats a crazy shot-- I done get it-- but I like it</td>', 'thats a crazy shot-- I done get it-- but I like it', '2003-09-14 23:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(418950, 36802, 4494, '<td valign="top">Maybe should have flipped it to landscape so to give a more "natural" feel to the picture.  Great macro, and nice background.</td>', 'Maybe should have flipped it to landscape so to give a more "natural" feel to the picture.  Great macro, and nice background.', '2003-09-14 23:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(418952, 36780, 5705, '<td valign="top">Awesome color, never seen a green bee-- 9</td>', 'Awesome color, never seen a green bee-- 9', '2003-09-14 23:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(418953, 36784, 5705, '<td valign="top">Its perfect focus-- best ive seen so far-- 10</td>', 'Its perfect focus-- best ive seen so far-- 10', '2003-09-14 23:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(418954, 36747, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL, you can barely see the ant!  I tried to take some ant pictures and they really tough.   If you macro in, it''s really hard to get the DOF focused on the ants because they are so small.<br/></td>', 'LOL, you can barely see the ant!  I tried to take some ant pictures and they really tough.   If you macro in, it''s really hard to get the DOF focused on the ants because they are so small.', '2003-09-14 23:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(418955, 36880, 4494, '<td valign="top">Maybe should have brightened it up a little and given slightly more contrast.  Great shot anyway, I really like the DOF with the out of focus flowers around.</td>', 'Maybe should have brightened it up a little and given slightly more contrast.  Great shot anyway, I really like the DOF with the out of focus flowers around.', '2003-09-14 23:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(418956, 36726, 5705, '<td valign="top">10 for Focus and for humor!!</td>', '10 for Focus and for humor!!', '2003-09-14 23:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(418958, 36829, 5705, '<td valign="top">Looks nice-- I say an 8</td>', 'Looks nice-- I say an 8', '2003-09-14 23:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(418960, 36879, 4494, '<td valign="top">Could have been a great shot if it were in focus a little more.  You must have been too close for the macro lens to focus?</td>', 'Could have been a great shot if it were in focus a little more.  You must have been too close for the macro lens to focus?', '2003-09-14 23:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(418961, 36572, 5705, '<td valign="top">Best butterfly in the group- great colors, and focus-- 10</td>', 'Best butterfly in the group- great colors, and focus-- 10', '2003-09-14 23:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(418962, 36449, 5705, '<td valign="top">2nd best butterfly-- 9</td>', '2nd best butterfly-- 9', '2003-09-14 23:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(418964, 36545, 4494, '<td valign="top">Awesome color and clarity on the butterfly.  You may want to think about cropping out the bottom leaf.  It would be OK I suppose if it didn''t have a big bit mark in it. :)</td>', 'Awesome color and clarity on the butterfly.  You may want to think about cropping out the bottom leaf.  It would be OK I suppose if it didn''t have a big bit mark in it. :)', '2003-09-14 23:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(418965, 36796, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL.  Nice macro with great focus.</td>', 'LOL.  Nice macro with great focus.', '2003-09-14 23:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(418966, 36292, 4494, '<td valign="top">Maybe crop it a little more to less of the white around the box.  Try 3/4 inch off the right, 1/2 inch off the top, and 3/8 to 1/2 off the bottom.  Nice creative shot!</td>', 'Maybe crop it a little more to less of the white around the box.  Try 3/4 inch off the right, 1/2 inch off the top, and 3/8 to 1/2 off the bottom.  Nice creative shot!', '2003-09-15 00:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(418969, 36581, 11873, '<td valign="top">This is a very excellent, artsy-looking image, but those look like cicada EXOSKELETONS to me. How can you get intimate with a couple of hollow shells?</td>', 'This is a very excellent, artsy-looking image, but those look like cicada EXOSKELETONS to me. How can you get intimate with a couple of hollow shells?', '2003-09-15 00:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(418970, 36784, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow that is fantastic!!  I love the illuminated wings.  Too bad that upper purple branch is there.  The contrast between the wings and background is exceptionally well done.  Excellent!  8.  You are the winner so far. :)</td>', 'Wow that is fantastic!!  I love the illuminated wings.  Too bad that upper purple branch is there.  The contrast between the wings and background is exceptionally well done.  Excellent!  8.  You are the winner so far. :)', '2003-09-15 00:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(418972, 36796, 5705, '<td valign="top">The title Makes me laugh my ass off-- 10</td>', 'The title Makes me laugh my ass off-- 10', '2003-09-15 00:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(418974, 36547, 11873, '<td valign="top">Looks very similar to some of the images that I have taken, but I would have shot different exposures also and this one would have gotten deleted due to the washed-out highlights. Better than average quality.</td>', 'Looks very similar to some of the images that I have taken, but I would have shot different exposures also and this one would have gotten deleted due to the washed-out highlights. Better than average quality.', '2003-09-15 00:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(418976, 36247, 4494, '<td valign="top">Looks like it''s a tiny bit out of focus.  Great background.  I would have cropped out the 3 little branches from the bottom because they are a little destracting.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Looks like it''s a tiny bit out of focus.  Great background.  I would have cropped out the 3 little branches from the bottom because they are a little destracting.  Nice shot.', '2003-09-15 00:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(418977, 36557, 5705, '<td valign="top">thats a pretty good hopper ( I should know)-- 10</td>', 'thats a pretty good hopper ( I should know)-- 10', '2003-09-15 00:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(418979, 36700, 11873, '<td valign="top">The critical focus should be on the EYES, but it ended up on rear end of the thorax. Looks like the image was sharpened to try and compensate.</td>', 'The critical focus should be on the EYES, but it ended up on rear end of the thorax. Looks like the image was sharpened to try and compensate.', '2003-09-15 00:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(418981, 36856, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  You should have either zoomed in more on the dragonfly or cropped it so only half the lilly is there.  That would be about 2 inches removed from the right.  This would also make the fly bigger.  Nice work I really like the colors in this shot.<br/></td>', 'Very nice.  You should have either zoomed in more on the dragonfly or cropped it so only half the lilly is there.  That would be about 2 inches removed from the right.  This would also make the fly bigger.  Nice work I really like the colors in this shot.', '2003-09-15 00:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(418982, 36832, 5705, '<td valign="top">Ribbon-- its a 10</td>', 'Ribbon-- its a 10', '2003-09-15 00:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(418984, 36832, 4494, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Great positioning of the bug, leaving the entire anteni in the shot.  Could maybe increase the contrast a little.</td>', 'Love it.  Great positioning of the bug, leaving the entire anteni in the shot.  Could maybe increase the contrast a little.', '2003-09-15 00:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(418986, 36871, 4494, '<td valign="top">That is a cool looking butterfly.  I would have cropped out some more of the tree trunk (about 1 inch) and maybe increased the amount of that nice green follage around it (right and below, not the top).</td>', 'That is a cool looking butterfly.  I would have cropped out some more of the tree trunk (about 1 inch) and maybe increased the amount of that nice green follage around it (right and below, not the top).', '2003-09-15 00:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(418987, 36575, 11873, '<td valign="top">This image has a lot of noise (grainy-looking) and is very lacking in color fidelity (range of tonal values like the grey scale below). Composition-wise, the problem is the grasshopper is looking away from us; it''s a butt-shot! Move around to the front of the grasshopper next time and shoot from a slightly lower angle.</td>', 'This image has a lot of noise (grainy-looking) and is very lacking in color fidelity (range of tonal values like the grey scale below). Composition-wise, the problem is the grasshopper is looking away from us; it''s a butt-shot! Move around to the front of the grasshopper next time and shoot from a slightly lower angle.', '2003-09-15 00:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(418989, 36872, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow this is another fantastic image.  The colors in this shot are so cool.  It looks like it was fabricated they are so perfect and "complimentary" to each other.  Your eye flows from top to bottom and back again.  Awesome!   You are tied for the lead in my opinion.  8.</td>', 'Wow this is another fantastic image.  The colors in this shot are so cool.  It looks like it was fabricated they are so perfect and "complimentary" to each other.  Your eye flows from top to bottom and back again.  Awesome!   You are tied for the lead in my opinion.  8.', '2003-09-15 00:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(418990, 36530, 11873, '<td valign="top">This image probably suffers from camera-induced blur. The whole image is unsharp due to the use of too low of a shutter speed for the magnification level. Was this hand held?</td>', 'This image probably suffers from camera-induced blur. The whole image is unsharp due to the use of too low of a shutter speed for the magnification level. Was this hand held?', '2003-09-15 00:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(418992, 36662, 11873, '<td valign="top">What is that line across the image? Was this taken through a window?</td>', 'What is that line across the image? Was this taken through a window?', '2003-09-15 00:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(418993, 36851, 11873, '<td valign="top">Nice subject; bad lighting, bad focus (focus on the eyes), depth of field is too shallow.</td>', 'Nice subject; bad lighting, bad focus (focus on the eyes), depth of field is too shallow.', '2003-09-15 00:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(418994, 36818, 11873, '<td valign="top">I''ve taken shots almost exactly like this a couple of years ago. Getting closer would have been more "intimate". One big problem: the challenge calls for INSECTS, and this is an ARACHNID. Don''t try to act like you don''t know the difference.</td>', 'I''ve taken shots almost exactly like this a couple of years ago. Getting closer would have been more "intimate". One big problem: the challenge calls for INSECTS, and this is an ARACHNID. Don''t try to act like you don''t know the difference.', '2003-09-15 00:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(418996, 36652, 4494, '<td valign="top">Need to make the shot bigger.  Nice subject.</td>', 'Need to make the shot bigger.  Nice subject.', '2003-09-15 00:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(418997, 36605, 11873, '<td valign="top">Great specimen! I have a really good image of a similar species myself. Unfortunately, I find this image lacking in tonal range and the critical focus is not on the EYES. Seems unsharp overall.</td>', 'Great specimen! I have a really good image of a similar species myself. Unfortunately, I find this image lacking in tonal range and the critical focus is not on the EYES. Seems unsharp overall.', '2003-09-15 00:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(418998, 36726, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL, that''s pretty funny.  Great lighting and perfect focus as well.</td>', 'LOL, that''s pretty funny.  Great lighting and perfect focus as well.', '2003-09-15 00:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(418999, 36833, 7711, '<td valign="top">beautiful use of DOF, I like the white moth (I think its a moth!) against the blurred yellow flowers. elegant composition.</td>', 'beautiful use of DOF, I like the white moth (I think its a moth!) against the blurred yellow flowers. elegant composition.', '2003-09-15 00:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(419000, 36690, 9232, '<td valign="top">I think this either needs to be brightened or have the saturation punched up.  Good depth of field.</td>', 'I think this either needs to be brightened or have the saturation punched up.  Good depth of field.', '2003-09-15 00:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(419002, 36292, 9232, '<td valign="top">Creative interpretation, good focus and good depth of field.  Good soft lighting with such a light background, too.  High marks for technical merit - 8</td>', 'Creative interpretation, good focus and good depth of field.  Good soft lighting with such a light background, too.  High marks for technical merit - 8', '2003-09-15 00:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(419003, 36856, 1041, '<td valign="top">A nice enough shot, however, really a shot of a lily that happens to have a dragonfly on it rather than a shot of a dragonfly, at least in my opinion.  Qualitywise, the focus is good, the background is blurry, but still within the context with the lily-pads and the colors are nice.  I wonder if it would''ve been possible not to crop the flower to the right ... since it''s just a bit it looks accidental even if it may not have been accidental.</td>', 'A nice enough shot, however, really a shot of a lily that happens to have a dragonfly on it rather than a shot of a dragonfly, at least in my opinion.  Qualitywise, the focus is good, the background is blurry, but still within the context with the lily-pads and the colors are nice.  I wonder if it would''ve been possible not to crop the flower to the right ... since it''s just a bit it looks accidental even if it may not have been accidental.', '2003-09-15 00:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(419004, 36459, 1041, '<td valign="top">Glad this is a legal one ... fantastic shot.  In my top three this week :)</td>', 'Glad this is a legal one ... fantastic shot.  In my top three this week :)', '2003-09-15 00:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(419005, 36697, 9232, '<td valign="top">Depth of field is a little shallow so that the mummified insect is OOF but good shot of the spider.  I''m sure you''re gonna be tired of the <i>it''s not an insect</i> comments so maybe this''ll help - 7  (I woulda liked a slightly different angle to show more of the spider''s <i>face</i></td>', 'Depth of field is a little shallow so that the mummified insect is OOF but good shot of the spider.  I''m sure you''re gonna be tired of the it''s not an insect comments so maybe this''ll help - 7  (I woulda liked a slightly different angle to show more of the spider''s face', '2003-09-15 00:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(419006, 36768, 9232, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  Nice depth of field.  Wish you could caught the wings extended to add more area covered by the insect.</td>', 'Great subject.  Nice depth of field.  Wish you could caught the wings extended to add more area covered by the insect.', '2003-09-15 00:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(419007, 36054, 9232, '<td valign="top">Light is a little harsh, the focus is a little soft and I''m not sure about the dept of field.  Good subject, though</td>', 'Light is a little harsh, the focus is a little soft and I''m not sure about the dept of field.  Good subject, though', '2003-09-15 00:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(419009, 36725, 9232, '<td valign="top">Light is too hot and the image is too busy with the web.  Perhaps a smaller depth of field and focusing on the spider through the web would have changed this photo for the better.</td>', 'Light is too hot and the image is too busy with the web.  Perhaps a smaller depth of field and focusing on the spider through the web would have changed this photo for the better.', '2003-09-15 00:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(419010, 36756, 9232, '<td valign="top">Way to frame the subject.  I also like the frame around the photo.  Good focus and depth of field.</td>', 'Way to frame the subject.  I also like the frame around the photo.  Good focus and depth of field.', '2003-09-15 00:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(419014, 36867, 1041, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  I love the very out of focus background and the beautiful pink of the flower.  If the bug was in focus, too, you''d have a winner here in my opinion, but it is not in focus.  I wonder what camera settings you used, I''ve started to use shutterpriority more and more for these shots because getting a certain shutterspeed is crucial to getting the insect in focus and in the end that''s what it''s all about.  Higher ISO sometimes also does the trick if your camera allows it.  I got to repeat it though, I do like the composition and framing :)</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  I love the very out of focus background and the beautiful pink of the flower.  If the bug was in focus, too, you''d have a winner here in my opinion, but it is not in focus.  I wonder what camera settings you used, I''ve started to use shutterpriority more and more for these shots because getting a certain shutterspeed is crucial to getting the insect in focus and in the end that''s what it''s all about.  Higher ISO sometimes also does the trick if your camera allows it.  I got to repeat it though, I do like the composition and framing :)', '2003-09-15 01:00:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(419015, 36020, 9232, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Jacko.  Even with a new boy here you are showing us all how to do it.<br/> <br/>Good job and great photo.</td>', 'Congrats, Jacko.  Even with a new boy here you are showing us all how to do it. Good job and great photo.', '2003-09-15 01:02:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(419016, 36459, 9232, '<td valign="top">Great shot, Bobster.  Well deserved ribbon.</td>', 'Great shot, Bobster.  Well deserved ribbon.', '2003-09-15 01:03:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(419017, 36477, 10686, '<td valign="top">Contrary to popular belief, they are NOT sitting on poop. It is a rock. I admit it looks kinda like poop, but it is a rock.</td>', 'Contrary to popular belief, they are NOT sitting on poop. It is a rock. I admit it looks kinda like poop, but it is a rock.', '2003-09-15 01:04:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(419020, 36824, 5333, '<td valign="top">A 6.7 for your 1st members challenge!!  WOO!!</td>', 'A 6.7 for your 1st members challenge!!  WOO!!', '2003-09-15 01:05:44.000000', NULL, 0),
