(419028, 36823, 11457, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite shot for this challenge. I gave it 10.<br/>The off-center subject and the shallow DoF create a (scary) sense of anxiety.</td>', 'This is my favourite shot for this challenge. I gave it 10.The off-center subject and the shallow DoF create a (scary) sense of anxiety.', '2003-09-15 01:09:27.000000', NULL, 0),
