(419035, 36754, 10275, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for the wonderful comments. <br/> <br/>I have learned so much with this one, and it was one of the most enjoyable photoshoots in my life. This little hopper survived 4 hours of my photo experiments and was released back to freedom unharmed.</td>', 'Thank you everyone for the wonderful comments.  I have learned so much with this one, and it was one of the most enjoyable photoshoots in my life. This little hopper survived 4 hours of my photo experiments and was released back to freedom unharmed.', '2003-09-15 01:13:29.000000', NULL, 0),
