(419041, 36873, 714, '<td valign="top">Congrats..This photo almost feels 3-d.  I feel like the flower is moving in the water.  Beautiful colors!</td>', 'Congrats..This photo almost feels 3-d.  I feel like the flower is moving in the water.  Beautiful colors!', '2003-09-15 01:18:13.000000', NULL, 0),
