(419123, 36875, 10643, '<td valign="top">I think it''s funny everyone mentioned the flower looking fake. It *is* a plastic flower. In a museum display. This is a very dead bug. I can''t get this close to the real ones!</td>', 'I think it''s funny everyone mentioned the flower looking fake. It *is* a plastic flower. In a museum display. This is a very dead bug. I can''t get this close to the real ones!', '2003-09-15 02:08:29.000000', NULL, 0),
