(419315, 36020, 656, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the win, Jacko</td>', 'Congrats on the win, Jacko', '2003-09-15 09:29:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(419316, 36796, 6521, '<td valign="top">I did not kill this WASP (NOT BEE) for the purpose of this shot, i saw her passing out on the sidewalk and decided to take a photo. I was testing the humor here and it didn´t work.</td>', 'I did not kill this WASP (NOT BEE) for the purpose of this shot, i saw her passing out on the sidewalk and decided to take a photo. I was testing the humor here and it didn´t work.', '2003-09-15 09:30:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(419317, 36020, 472, '<td valign="top">good job. i like how he''s smiling even tho he''s mortally wounded. lol.</td>', 'good job. i like how he''s smiling even tho he''s mortally wounded. lol.', '2003-09-15 09:34:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(419318, 36292, 472, '<td valign="top">cute!</td>', 'cute!', '2003-09-15 09:35:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(419322, 36754, 472, '<td valign="top">congrats on your ''green'' ribbon</td>', 'congrats on your ''green'' ribbon', '2003-09-15 09:37:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(419340, 36873, 656, '<td valign="top">Awesome colours, great contrast.  Bug almost secondary to the shot unless it was red so makes a great detail.</td>', 'Awesome colours, great contrast.  Bug almost secondary to the shot unless it was red so makes a great detail.', '2003-09-15 09:54:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(419352, 36572, 656, '<td valign="top">Very crisp.  Good shot.</td>', 'Very crisp.  Good shot.', '2003-09-15 10:08:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(419373, 36873, 2178, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, the colors pop!</td>', 'Nicely done, the colors pop!', '2003-09-15 10:25:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(419400, 36020, 255, '<td valign="top">aww, poor dragon fly. :( hope you saved him!<br/>such an awesome shot anyway, you rock as usual! :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'aww, poor dragon fly. :( hope you saved him!such an awesome shot anyway, you rock as usual! :) ', '2003-09-15 10:46:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(419405, 36459, 255, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot with perfect clarity--congrats bob!</td>', 'beautiful shot with perfect clarity--congrats bob!', '2003-09-15 10:48:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(419411, 36317, 200, '<td valign="top">nice shot and nicely artistic!</td>', 'nice shot and nicely artistic!', '2003-09-15 10:51:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(419417, 36037, 200, '<td valign="top">good job!</td>', 'good job!', '2003-09-15 10:53:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(419419, 36696, 200, '<td valign="top">I felt this was one of the better bug shots...for my own perspective :)</td>', 'I felt this was one of the better bug shots...for my own perspective :)', '2003-09-15 10:54:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(419427, 36800, 200, '<td valign="top">I can not believe you got last on this! How funny. Sometimes I purposely try to get last place. For the record...I gave this very high marks. Its an excellent photo and a wonderful perspective...very clever. I didnt think of it myself...you impressed me on that one!</td>', 'I can not believe you got last on this! How funny. Sometimes I purposely try to get last place. For the record...I gave this very high marks. Its an excellent photo and a wonderful perspective...very clever. I didnt think of it myself...you impressed me on that one!', '2003-09-15 10:57:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(419431, 36483, 8367, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes and critiques. <br/>I have an even greater admiration for macro photographers after this attempt. Yes, I did bring him inside and set him on the kitchen counter with a brightly colored flower to match his coloring.  I agree, the eye should be in focus. I tried. He kept jumping off the counter! Shot about 10 shots and turned him loose.</td>', 'Thanks for the votes and critiques. I have an even greater admiration for macro photographers after this attempt. Yes, I did bring him inside and set him on the kitchen counter with a brightly colored flower to match his coloring.  I agree, the eye should be in focus. I tried. He kept jumping off the counter! Shot about 10 shots and turned him loose.', '2003-09-15 10:58:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(419487, 36020, 10985, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro, Jacques! Félicitations pour le ruban.</td>', 'Excellent macro, Jacques! Félicitations pour le ruban.', '2003-09-15 11:26:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(419538, 36459, 10145, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Love the insect photos.</td>', 'Great shot! Love the insect photos.', '2003-09-15 11:42:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(419550, 36037, 472, '<td valign="top">i thought this cute with the ''blanket'' .. lol</td>', 'i thought this cute with the ''blanket'' .. lol', '2003-09-15 11:46:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(419563, 36776, 2883, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...30th overall. Well, at least I didn''t get any 1''s on this.</td>', 'Hmmm...30th overall. Well, at least I didn''t get any 1''s on this.', '2003-09-15 11:54:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(419595, 36800, 5112, '<td valign="top">I am so impressed that you got last place with such a neat picture.  I must say, not everyone can do that!  Congratulations.  But I''m joking.  It''s a lovely picture, and I thought it was a good entry to the insects challenge, it shows imagination!</td>', 'I am so impressed that you got last place with such a neat picture.  I must say, not everyone can do that!  Congratulations.  But I''m joking.  It''s a lovely picture, and I thought it was a good entry to the insects challenge, it shows imagination!', '2003-09-15 12:26:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(419620, 36809, 2883, '<td valign="top">Personally, I think you were robbed. This should have placed a lot higher!</td>', 'Personally, I think you were robbed. This should have placed a lot higher!', '2003-09-15 12:40:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(419634, 36470, 11873, '<td valign="top">Thank you to everyone who gave me positive feedback! I really appreciate your support and enthusiasm.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-19 16:05:17.</i></td>', 'Thank you to everyone who gave me positive feedback! I really appreciate your support and enthusiasm.', '2003-09-15 13:11:01.000000', '2003-10-19 17:05:17.000000', 0),
(419639, 36866, 714, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe mine beat yours.  I love the deep tones.  Excellent shot!</td>', 'I can''t believe mine beat yours.  I love the deep tones.  Excellent shot!', '2003-09-15 13:14:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(419642, 36754, 11873, '<td valign="top">Great job!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-09-15 12:31:19.</i></td>', 'Great job!', '2003-09-15 13:17:49.000000', '2003-09-15 13:31:19.000000', 0),
(419652, 36776, 7778, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see how anyone would think of two''s and three''s, yet seven voters did, apparently without explaining why. The 4 and 5 vote, I''m speculating, may have come from those who detected something in this shot they didn''t expect  and were threatened by it?- <br/> <br/>The graph, however, shows that not all is lost, vonautsch. ;-)</td>', 'I don''t really see how anyone would think of two''s and three''s, yet seven voters did, apparently without explaining why. The 4 and 5 vote, I''m speculating, may have come from those who detected something in this shot they didn''t expect  and were threatened by it?-  The graph, however, shows that not all is lost, vonautsch. ;-)', '2003-09-15 13:23:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(419684, 36843, 472, '<td valign="top">no 1''s or 2''s?  i must be doing something right!!!!</td>', 'no 1''s or 2''s?  i must be doing something right!!!!', '2003-09-15 13:46:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(419686, 36459, 10985, '<td valign="top">Wow, what clarity. Great shot. The detail is amazing in the wings. Nicely composed, too.</td>', 'Wow, what clarity. Great shot. The detail is amazing in the wings. Nicely composed, too.', '2003-09-15 13:48:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(419710, 36301, 10149, '<td valign="top">Yes, That''s right out of the camera, no croping, no edit. I''m new at this so I keep it simple. I called it a grasshopper. I notice since I have started taking pictures. There are alot of different grasshoppers and dragonflies.</td>', 'Yes, That''s right out of the camera, no croping, no edit. I''m new at this so I keep it simple. I called it a grasshopper. I notice since I have started taking pictures. There are alot of different grasshoppers and dragonflies.', '2003-09-15 14:12:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(419740, 36816, 10992, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I want to thank everyone for their comments!  This is my first entry and I am very pleased to have done as well as I did.  I''ve only had my Nikon 5700 camera for a few weeks and am still in a huge learning curve.  I agree that this is a bit fuzzy, and I think I may have cropped it too much.  The metering was the default auto setting.  I did really like the contrast in this shot, but agree that it looks overexposed.</td>', 'Wow!  I want to thank everyone for their comments!  This is my first entry and I am very pleased to have done as well as I did.  I''ve only had my Nikon 5700 camera for a few weeks and am still in a huge learning curve.  I agree that this is a bit fuzzy, and I think I may have cropped it too much.  The metering was the default auto setting.  I did really like the contrast in this shot, but agree that it looks overexposed.', '2003-09-15 14:57:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(419748, 36824, 5982, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your place but I had voted a 10 for this shot. Just to let you know!  Nice shot!</td>', 'Congrats on your place but I had voted a 10 for this shot. Just to let you know!  Nice shot!', '2003-09-15 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(419749, 36846, 5982, '<td valign="top">congrats on this pictures, I had voted a 10 for it! Nice shot!</td>', 'congrats on this pictures, I had voted a 10 for it! Nice shot!', '2003-09-15 15:10:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(419750, 36529, 5982, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I think it deserved a better rank...</td>', 'Nice shot!  I think it deserved a better rank...', '2003-09-15 15:11:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(419751, 36776, 5982, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  I gave it a 9.  I think you deserved a better rank.  Congrats on this superb shot.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  I gave it a 9.  I think you deserved a better rank.  Congrats on this superb shot.', '2003-09-15 15:13:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(419752, 36483, 5982, '<td valign="top">A pretty nice shot but such a ugly insect!  I think this is why you didn''t get a better rank but technically it should have rank higher to my opinion.  Good shot.</td>', 'A pretty nice shot but such a ugly insect!  I think this is why you didn''t get a better rank but technically it should have rank higher to my opinion.  Good shot.', '2003-09-15 15:14:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(419753, 36020, 5982, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  One of my few 10s of this challenge!  Great shot!</td>', 'Congrats!  One of my few 10s of this challenge!  Great shot!', '2003-09-15 15:15:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(419754, 36866, 675, '<td valign="top">WOW i can''t believe this is sitting down here. your choice of b&amp;w is very bold and to me it works extremely well.  very nice job.  i just saw the color version it is just as striking and maybe even more engaging. man you got robbed!! adding to my favorites<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-09-15 14:18:19.</i></td>', 'WOW i can''t believe this is sitting down here. your choice of b&w is very bold and to me it works extremely well.  very nice job.  i just saw the color version it is just as striking and maybe even more engaging. man you got robbed!! adding to my favorites', '2003-09-15 15:15:21.000000', '2003-09-15 15:18:19.000000', 0),
(419755, 36459, 5982, '<td valign="top">Just a perfect shot!  Congrats!</td>', 'Just a perfect shot!  Congrats!', '2003-09-15 15:15:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(419756, 36843, 472, '<td valign="top">Oh.  A lot of people said they had never seen this before.  Turns out that there are these ants who''s role is to act as living food storage units for the hive, for use in lean times.  They just grab on and hang, and their abdomens fill with sugary substance.  If you look at the picture, you can see the ''access port'' on top.  It''s like the ''keg''s tap'' :) .. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh.  A lot of people said they had never seen this before.  Turns out that there are these ants who''s role is to act as living food storage units for the hive, for use in lean times.  They just grab on and hang, and their abdomens fill with sugary substance.  If you look at the picture, you can see the ''access port'' on top.  It''s like the ''keg''s tap'' :) ..  ', '2003-09-15 15:20:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(419761, 36529, 6405, '<td valign="top">It was very tough competition,many beautiful pics !Yhanks guys for your support..  :-)</td>', 'It was very tough competition,many beautiful pics !Yhanks guys for your support..  :-)', '2003-09-15 15:29:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(419791, 36829, 6900, '<td valign="top">David - I actually centered this guy because of the triangle of lines.  I thought by putting the lines on the thirds it would show up better as part of the picture.  *shrug* :)<br/> <br/>I think the centering hurt this score - but only because we''re taught at DPC "never center, never center."  I think there are times to break the rule and I definitely did it on purpose.  Maybe it wasn''t effective.<br/> <br/>@Stdavidson - I used NeatImage with a sharpening to achieve the non-pixelated background - plus I didn''t overzoom and I always shoot on iso 100.<br/> <br/>M</td>', 'David - I actually centered this guy because of the triangle of lines.  I thought by putting the lines on the thirds it would show up better as part of the picture.  *shrug* :) I think the centering hurt this score - but only because we''re taught at DPC "never center, never center."  I think there are times to break the rule and I definitely did it on purpose.  Maybe it wasn''t effective. @Stdavidson - I used NeatImage with a sharpening to achieve the non-pixelated background - plus I didn''t overzoom and I always shoot on iso 100. M', '2003-09-15 15:48:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(419810, 36824, 6064, '<td valign="top">Well done, Scott top ten on the A40 picture board :)</td>', 'Well done, Scott top ten on the A40 picture board :)', '2003-09-15 15:56:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(419882, 36020, 1717, '<td valign="top">jacko...this pic ROCKS!  and so do you! :)  congratulations!</td>', 'jacko...this pic ROCKS!  and so do you! :)  congratulations!', '2003-09-15 17:05:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(420001, 36754, 10263, '<td valign="top">Grats on 4th place. I thought it would place higher. I gave you an 8. I love this shot.</td>', 'Grats on 4th place. I thought it would place higher. I gave you an 8. I love this shot.', '2003-09-15 18:59:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(420019, 36459, 9448, '<td valign="top">Great shot, detail in particular, especially for one handed.</td>', 'Great shot, detail in particular, especially for one handed.', '2003-09-15 19:11:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(420052, 36459, 9385, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail, congratulations</td>', 'Wonderful detail, congratulations', '2003-09-15 19:49:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(420055, 36477, 9385, '<td valign="top">I am amazed that you didn''t get a higher score. This is one of my favorites for this challenge. I know how dificult it is to get a good shot of insects this small. Not only did you get the Lady Beetles you got , in great detail and good focus the much smaller black beetles.</td>', 'I am amazed that you didn''t get a higher score. This is one of my favorites for this challenge. I know how dificult it is to get a good shot of insects this small. Not only did you get the Lady Beetles you got , in great detail and good focus the much smaller black beetles.', '2003-09-15 19:57:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(420067, 36575, 6683, '<td valign="top">An excellent close-up....I think it should have done better...but, there were many very good entries....keep up the good work.</td>', 'An excellent close-up....I think it should have done better...but, there were many very good entries....keep up the good work.', '2003-09-15 20:20:47.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(420076, 36800, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whoa, JJ mon ami - this must be the best photo ever to get last place :-) Love the fact that you got a few 10''s though - there is hope here yet.</td>', 'Whoa, JJ mon ami - this must be the best photo ever to get last place :-) Love the fact that you got a few 10''s though - there is hope here yet.', '2003-09-15 20:30:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(420143, 36459, 5705, '<td valign="top">Another great shot Bobster--  We have finished right next to each in a few challenges-- but your shot was superiour this challenge-- glad it ribboned!</td>', 'Another great shot Bobster--  We have finished right next to each in a few challenges-- but your shot was superiour this challenge-- glad it ribboned!', '2003-09-15 22:40:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(420174, 36824, 4712, '<td valign="top">should have placed higher, its a 10</td>', 'should have placed higher, its a 10', '2003-09-15 23:41:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(420206, 36866, 4712, '<td valign="top">Wow Franziska, you amaze me every time with your images.  B&amp;W was an interesting look, to set you apart from the rest of the field. It could use more DOF, but overall GREAT!</td>', 'Wow Franziska, you amaze me every time with your images.  B&W was an interesting look, to set you apart from the rest of the field. It could use more DOF, but overall GREAT!', '2003-09-16 00:01:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(420248, 36020, 9523, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful, and it''s as if he''s smiling. :D<br/> <br/>Who on earth would give this a 2? Moron.<br/> <br/>Mes félicitations encore (vu que vous comprenez le français).<br/> <br/>-Nick<br/><a href="//nickcoffey.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//nickcoffey.com</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-09-15 23:56:11.</i></td>', 'Absolutely wonderful, and it''s as if he''s smiling. :D Who on earth would give this a 2? Moron. Mes félicitations encore (vu que vous comprenez le français). -Nick//nickcoffey.com', '2003-09-16 00:55:50.000000', '2003-09-16 00:56:11.000000', 0),
(420350, 36873, 11073, '<td valign="top">what a great shot. very pleasing to the eye.  great detail - tips of the petals in the water, the water drops on the flower, etc.  nice work.</td>', 'what a great shot. very pleasing to the eye.  great detail - tips of the petals in the water, the water drops on the flower, etc.  nice work.', '2003-09-16 02:48:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(420358, 36020, 9251, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! He looks so happy..Nice shot..</td>', 'Wonderful! He looks so happy..Nice shot..', '2003-09-16 03:06:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(420361, 36824, 7151, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the kind comments.  If your interested in some other views of my "shy" bug, check out my portfolio, in the outtakes folder.</td>', 'Thank you all for the kind comments.  If your interested in some other views of my "shy" bug, check out my portfolio, in the outtakes folder.', '2003-09-16 03:13:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(420366, 36020, 8068, '<td valign="top">Well done! That is a brilliant shot!</td>', 'Well done! That is a brilliant shot!', '2003-09-16 03:19:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(420370, 36292, 6999, '<td valign="top">Thanks as always for all votes and comments. A few ''answers'' :-)<br/> <br/>ChrisW - no. Tried a closer crop, and it crowded the image; and anyway, why would I want a dead-centre image?<br/> <br/>It isn''t a spoof on the forum threads - I hadn''t read them.<br/> <br/>And as ever, interesting to get such varied opinions from people.</td>', 'Thanks as always for all votes and comments. A few ''answers'' :-) ChrisW - no. Tried a closer crop, and it crowded the image; and anyway, why would I want a dead-centre image? It isn''t a spoof on the forum threads - I hadn''t read them. And as ever, interesting to get such varied opinions from people.', '2003-09-16 03:40:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(420371, 36020, 6999, '<td valign="top">Congrats Jacko: everyone said your were going to win, which I thought would be a jinx - great work to avaoid that :-)</td>', 'Congrats Jacko: everyone said your were going to win, which I thought would be a jinx - great work to avaoid that :-)', '2003-09-16 03:42:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(420373, 36459, 6999, '<td valign="top">Top work Bob. Must say I approve of your technique and approach as described in your notes - though i think if you were, say, holding a gin and tonic in the other hand rather than a phone it would improve the shot :-) Congratulations (from someone who spent hours slaving over a shot ...)</td>', 'Top work Bob. Must say I approve of your technique and approach as described in your notes - though i think if you were, say, holding a gin and tonic in the other hand rather than a phone it would improve the shot :-) Congratulations (from someone who spent hours slaving over a shot ...)', '2003-09-16 03:45:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(420402, 36459, 8522, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your kind comments!<br/>I''ll have to see what team Optio S (me) can do for the macro challenge now... ;-)</td>', 'Thanks for all your kind comments!I''ll have to see what team Optio S (me) can do for the macro challenge now... ;-)', '2003-09-16 07:39:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(420440, 36681, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here of both the insect and the bark of the twig its resting on.</td>', 'I like the colors here of both the insect and the bark of the twig its resting on.', '2003-09-16 09:49:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(420600, 36796, 3554, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot (gave it a 9). It was in my top 3 shots. I think the focus is good and the colors are wonderful. I also really liked the title.<br/> <br/>I still can''t figure out how this shot ended up down here.</td>', 'I really liked this shot (gave it a 9). It was in my top 3 shots. I think the focus is good and the colors are wonderful. I also really liked the title. I still can''t figure out how this shot ended up down here.', '2003-09-16 13:35:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(420615, 36448, 6870, '<td valign="top">Hi JC, I was commenting on this yesterday when a student needed a form signed. Then I had to leave. So here goes. <br/> <br/>As usual, you always manage to build an interesting and appropriate mood in your photo. I like the planet-like look to this one. The highlights on the insect really draw my eye to it. <br/> <br/>The insect does not seem out of focus, but it does not seem really clear either. Perhaps it''s the amber, which is pretty groovy stuff, I might add (if you have any extra chunks lying around, I''ll take them off your hands!). If the fly looks clear when you examine it closely and if you''re sure it is your camera that''s causing the unclarity, make sure you didn''t over sharpen it, and make sure you didn''t move ever so slightly when taking the shot. Easy to do with such an extreme macro! I imagine that the clarity was the hang up here. It may be that you simply need more light. More light gives you lots of options. <br/> <br/>The composition is very nice; with the fly in the upper right third, its little amber world is implied more clearly than if you had centered it.<br/> <br/>All in all, a nice photo; I hope you keep giving us bizarre and interesting things to look at!<br/> <br/>David</td>', 'Hi JC, I was commenting on this yesterday when a student needed a form signed. Then I had to leave. So here goes.  As usual, you always manage to build an interesting and appropriate mood in your photo. I like the planet-like look to this one. The highlights on the insect really draw my eye to it.  The insect does not seem out of focus, but it does not seem really clear either. Perhaps it''s the amber, which is pretty groovy stuff, I might add (if you have any extra chunks lying around, I''ll take them off your hands!). If the fly looks clear when you examine it closely and if you''re sure it is your camera that''s causing the unclarity, make sure you didn''t over sharpen it, and make sure you didn''t move ever so slightly when taking the shot. Easy to do with such an extreme macro! I imagine that the clarity was the hang up here. It may be that you simply need more light. More light gives you lots of options.  The composition is very nice; with the fly in the upper right third, its little amber world is implied more clearly than if you had centered it. All in all, a nice photo; I hope you keep giving us bizarre and interesting things to look at! David', '2003-09-16 14:00:37.000000', NULL, 0),
