(420862, 36203, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot Renee!  I''m glad the spider not an insect folks didn''t vote this down too hard.  I went for a 9, but hindsight says this could have easily been a 10.  The level of detail is EXCELLENT!  Great color.  A tiny nit with the upper right corner, but honestly, I almost missed it.  Your title is a killer!  All around a very, very good shot!</td>', 'Very nice shot Renee!  I''m glad the spider not an insect folks didn''t vote this down too hard.  I went for a 9, but hindsight says this could have easily been a 10.  The level of detail is EXCELLENT!  Great color.  A tiny nit with the upper right corner, but honestly, I almost missed it.  Your title is a killer!  All around a very, very good shot!', '2003-09-16 20:38:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(420952, 36856, 3205, '<td valign="top">Here is the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=38157" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Original</a> photograph before I cropped it.  I was trying to follow the rule of thirds, by cropping the image so that the dragonfly was positioned at the intersection of the upper left quadran.  Also so that the lilly was not the primary focus of this composition.  Thank you for all of your wonderful and constructive comments!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-09-16 21:59:44.</i></td>', 'Here is the Original photograph before I cropped it.  I was trying to follow the rule of thirds, by cropping the image so that the dragonfly was positioned at the intersection of the upper left quadran.  Also so that the lilly was not the primary focus of this composition.  Thank you for all of your wonderful and constructive comments!', '2003-09-16 22:58:48.000000', '2003-09-16 22:59:44.000000', 0),
