(435292, 36470, 675, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by quadangle:</b></div><hr/><i>It''s pretty obvious that a few people deliberately voted low for my photo after I critiqued their images and they couldn''t take the constructive criticism. Okay, so maybe I was a little bit too honest in my comments. I guess I have to kiss butts from now on and no longer offer any suggestions. Yes, from now on I will only post positive comments telling everyone how great their photos are.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>how would they know the photo they were voting on was yours?</td>', 'Originally posted by quadangle:It''s pretty obvious that a few people deliberately voted low for my photo after I critiqued their images and they couldn''t take the constructive criticism. Okay, so maybe I was a little bit too honest in my comments. I guess I have to kiss butts from now on and no longer offer any suggestions. Yes, from now on I will only post positive comments telling everyone how great their photos are.  how would they know the photo they were voting on was yours?', '2003-09-30 11:25:29.000000', NULL, 0),
